\id 1KI  
\toc1 Lengte Khatna 
\toc2 1 Lengte 
\toc3 1 Lgt 
\mt1 1 KINGS  
\mt2 LENGTE LEKHABU  
\mt3 KHATNA  
\is1 1 Kings Lekhabu Sung Thu Umdan  
\ip Hiche lekhabu sunga hi Samuel lekhabu anina Israel te leng thusim kisei ban kiseijom nalai ahi. David hinkho thusim achaina lam a akipanin, chule Solomon Leng vaipoh hung kipatna thusim jong akimun ahi. Lekhabu akeh khat sunga hin Solomon Leng vaipoh sunga Pathen'in apeh chihna a aleng vaipoh dan le anop dan, akhantou dan, akitup dan chujongleh imalam jousea khantouna ana nei dan'u akimun ahi. Hijeh a chu Solomon Leng vaipoh sung hi Sana Khang (Golden Age) tin jong Israel te thusim'ah akihen ahi. Ahinlah achaina lam ahin Solomon in Torah “Leng ho dia Dan” (Deut.17:14-17) sunga kimu thil thum nahsah louva ana koi thusim jong akimun ahi. Mose in koi hileh leng kiti pou-pou chu ama chang kitim them dia ana gah ho chu ana nahsah louna akimu theijin ahi. Hiho chu:b  
\ili Thaneina/Thuneina ngailut val louding  
\ili Nopsahna ngailut val louding  
\ili Nei le gou ngailut val louding  
\ip Solomon miching tah ahijeng vang'in, milim doi hou, nei le gou , nopsahna thangkol a ngol hoitah in ana tang denin ahi.  
\ip Solomon thi nungin achapa Rehoboam in apa khonung ajuijin, mipi ho chunga chun kai (tax) tamtah ahinla in ahile alenggam kehni in ana kikhenlo in ahi: Sahlam Lenggam (Israel) chule Lhanglam Lenggam (Judah) ahi.  
\is1 Lekhabu Jihpa, Akijih Kum Chule Asung Thudol  
\ip Koipen in ajih ham ti vang hetchet ahipon, ahinlah Israel te pomdan in Jeremiah Themgao in asut ahi ding ginchat aum'in ahi. Babylon sohchanga aumlai uva kisun hi dingin ginchatna alenin ahi. Chuti chu ahile, akisutna phat hi 560 BC – 550 BC sung hidin ginchat ahi.  
\ip Hiche Lengte Khatna sunga athupi pen chu Pakai Themgaovin hangsan tah a Pathen thu aseiya, milimdoi hou louna dia mipi ana pho a chule Pathen thu anit tei-teina diuva ana hilchah ho chu ahiuve. Hetthei ding khat chu: Elijah le Baal themgao ho toh akitet nau thusim chu ahi.  
\c 1  
\s1 David Lengpa Ateh Thusim  
\p
\v 1 David lengpa jong ateh lheh tan, ponlum ijat asilpeh vangun ama chu alum jou mong- mong tapon ahi.  
\v 2 Hijeh chun alhacha a pang hon David lengpa jah a, “Kapu, nang dingin nungah theng khat naumpi ding le najenle dingin hol uhite. Chutileh aman lum nasahna din naluppi le phante,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 3 Hiti chun ama hon Israel gamsung pumpia nungah mel-hoi tah khat ahol un ahileh Shunem’a kon'in Abishag kitinu chu a mudoh un Lengpa kom'a chun ahin puilut tauvin ahi.  
\v 4 Hiche nungahnu chu ahoi lheh jengin ama chun lengpa chu avesuijin ajenle tan ahi. Ahinlah lengpa chun akitimatpi thei tapon ahi.   
\s1 Adonijah In Laltouna Achu  
\p
\v 5 Hiche phat lai chun David leh Haggith chapa Adonijah chun “Keima leng ka chan ding ahi” tin aki phongdoh tan ahi. Hichun aman sakol kangtalai tamtah akisemdoh in chuleh achunga touthem ho jong akigo uvin chuleh ama masanga lamhonga pang dingin mi somnga alhaisah in ahi. \x + \xo 1:5 \xt 2 Samuel 3:4\x*  
\v 6 Apa David Lengpan la “Ipi bol’a nahim?” tin khatvei cha jong aphoh kha pon chule ahil jong ahil khapon ahi. Hiche Adonijah hi Absalom pen jouva peng’a ahin, ama jong hi mi mel-hoi tah khat ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Lengmun alogotna ahin Adonijah in Zeruiah chapa Joab le Abiathar thempu pa chu ama langa pang dingin ana kijol lut in chule amanin jong anoppeh tan ahi.  
\v 8 Ahinlah Zadok thempupa leh Jehoiada chapa Benaiah, themgao Nathan, Simei, Rei chuleh David veng them'a pang mihat hon vang ana panpi pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Adonijah chun En-rogel twinah kom'a Zoheleth song phunga chun ache in chule hilai mun'ah chun kelngoi ho, bongchal ho leh bongnou thao tah-tah ho mangchan pumgo thilto anabol tan ahi. Hichea chun David lengpa chapa te, asopi ho chengse ho leh Judah gamsung’a Lengpa ding’a panmun neiho jouse jong ana kou khom'in ahi.  
\v 10 Ahinlah aman Nathan themgao, Benaiah chule lengpa vengtup a pang ho chujongleh asopipa Solomon ana koupon ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Hichun Nathan chu Solomon nu Bathsheba kom'a achen, hiti hin aga dong tan ahi, “Haggith chapa Adonijah chu ama leh ama leng in akisem tan ahi ti na jahdoh lou ham? Chuleh lengpan jong ana jahdoh khah lou ham?” \x + \xo 1:11 \xt 2 Samuel 12:24\x*  
\v 12 “Nang leh na chapa Solomon hinkho na hoidoh nom le keiman ka seipeh bang-bang hin juijin,” atipeh tan ahi.  
\v 13 Tun gangtah in Lengpa kom'a chen lang hitin gasei tan, “Kapu Lengpa, nangin na chapa Solomon hi kei banna leng hung chang ding ahi neina tipeh hilou ham? tua hi i-atileh Adonijah khu leng chang hitam?  
\v 14 Chule nangin hi tia chu akom'a thu na na seipeh tah leh keima hung lut in ting na thusei chu ka hung suhdet ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 15 Hiti chun Bathsheba chu Lengpa lupna dan sunga chun alut in Lengpa chu ateh behseh tan Abishag chun ajen jingin ahi.  
\v 16 Bathsheba chu lengpa ang’a chun abohkhup in ahileh aman,  
\p “Ipi nadei ham?” ahin tin ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Amanun adonbut in, “Ka pakai, nangma Pakai na Pathen masang’a na kihahsel in ka kom'ah hitin na-na seijin ahi: na chapa Solomon hi kei ban'a ka laltouna mun a hi leng hung chang tei ding ahi, tin na-na seijin ahi.  
\v 18 Ahinlah tun Adonijah hi ama leh ama lengin akisem tan ahinlah nangin na hepha pon ahi.  
\v 19 Aman bongchal ho, bongnou thaotah tah ho leh kelngoi ho athat in pumgo thilto aboltan, lengpa chate dangse akouvin kei chapa Solomon akou pon chuleh aman themgao Abiathar leh sepai lamkai Joab jong akouvin ahi.  
\v 20 Tuhin, ka pakai, Israel mipite jousen nang ban a leng chang ding hi koi pen nahi sah ding ham? tia avet cheh u ahi.  
\v 21 Tua hi nangin pan nalah vah louleh nathi nung leh ka chapa Solomon toh keini hi themmona nei khat banga eikibol lhon ding ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 22 Amanun hitia thu ana sei sungin Nathan themgao chu akom aga lhungin ahi.  
\v 23 “Nathan themgao ahungin na kimupi nom’e,” tichu lengpa aseipeh tauvin,  
\p hichun Nathan themgao alut in lengpa kom achun akhupboh in achun amai tol’a asulut jeng tan ahi.  
\v 24 Nathan in, “Kapu lengpa, nangin Adonijah hi nang ban a leng chang dinga na-na phondoh khah em?  
\v 25 Tunin aman bongchal ho, bongnou thao tah-tah ho leh kelngoi ho pumgo thilto abol in hichea chun lengpa chate, sepai lamkai ho, Abiathar themgao pa akouvin ama hon aneuvin adon un 'Leng Adoniah hingsot hen!' tin asam un ahi.  
\v 26 Aman kei leh thempupa Zadok leh Benaiah chuleh nasoh Solomon jong akou pon ahi.  
\v 27 Kapu Lengpa nangin hiche hi nang ding’a panmun neiho hetsah louva nang ban a leng chang ding hi nalhen khat tou hitam?” ati.   
\s1 David In Solomon Leng Dia Atun  
\p
\v 28 David lengpan ahin donbut in, “Bathsheba chu gakouvin!” ati. Hichun amanu ahungin lengpa masanga ading tan ahi.  
\v 29 Hichun Lengpan akihahselna chu avelsei kit in, “Keiman hahsatna kato channa eina huhdoh hingjing Pakai min a kasei ahi.  
\v 30 Na chapa Solomon chun keima bantah a lengmun chu Pakai Israel Pathen min a ka kitepna dungjuiya tuni tah a hi alo ding ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 31 Hichun Bathsheba chu akun in tol'ah amai asulut in Lengpa chu salam abol in aseitai, “Kapu Lengpa David hing sot hen!” ati.   
\p
\v 32 Hichun David lengpan thu apen “Zadok thempupa, themgao Nathan le Jehoiada chapa Benaiah gakou un,” ati. Amaho lengpa angsung’a ahung lhun phat un,  
\v 33 lengpan amaho kom'ah asei tan ahi, “Solomon leh kei ding’a panmun nei ho chengse chu Gihon Twiputna mun’a chun pui unlang chuleh Solomon chu keima sakol pol chung’a chun tousah un.  
\v 34 Hichea chun Thempupa Zadok le Themgao pa Nathan in Israel pumpi chunga leng chang dingin Solomon chu thao ganu lhon henlang saki pengkul chu mut un chuleh 'Lengpa Solomon hingsot hen!' tin sam un.  
\v 35 Chujou teng hilanga hinlepui kit un ka laltouna a tousah un. Keima Lengmun lo ding leh Israel leh Judah chung’a vaihom dinga keiman ka pansah ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 36 Jehoiadah chapa Benaiah chun adonbut in “Hihen! Pakai, ka pakai lengpa Pathen'in jong hichu guilhun sah hen” ati.  
\v 37 “Kapu Lengpa nangma na-na umpi jing bangin Pakaijin Solomon jong umpi hen chuleh Solomon vaihopna gam chu nanga sang'in letsah jo hen!” atiuvin ahi   
\p
\v 38 Hiti chun Thempupa Zadok, Themgao pa Nathan leh Jehoiada chapa Benaiah chuleh Lengpa vesui sepai hon Gihon mun lang’a chun Solomon chu apuiyun apa sakolpol chunga chun a tousah un ahi.  
\v 39 Hiche mun achun thempupa Zadok chun indan thenga kon'in Olive thao atheija um chu alan Solomon chu anu peh in ahi. Hijou chun saki sumkon chu amut un “Leng Solomon hingsot hen,” tin asam un ahi.  
\v 40 Hiche jou chun mipi hon Solomon chu Jerusalem geijin ajuiyun kuli amut un kipahtah in asam un, akipanau ogin kithong tah a asap uchun leiset jeng jong akithin sah leu jengin ahi.   
\p
\v 41 Adonijah leh aloi agol ho chun golvah abol chai jouvun Solomon leng chan husa thong jejun ajauvin saki pengkul kimut gin chu Joab in ajah doh phat in, “Khopi sung khubanga choh jeju khu ipi kibolna hitan tem?” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 42 Hiche thu chu asei pettah un, Abiathar Thempupa chapa Jonathan chu ahunglhung tan ahileh Adonijah in “Hunglutnin ajeh chu nang hi mipha nahin na thupoh jong thupha hi ngei inte,” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 43 Jonathan in adonbut in “Ahinai saipoi! David Lengpan tutah chun Solomon chu leng ahitai tin aphong doh in ahi! ati.  
\v 44 Lengpan ama chu Gihon geijin asol suh in, Zadok Thempu pa le Nathan Themgaopa leh Jehoiada chapa Benaiah toh Lengpa vesuija pang sepai hon ahin juijun ahi. Lengpa Sakolpol a chun Solomon atousah un ahi.  
\v 45 Zadok le Nathan in Gihon ah leng dingin thao anu lhon'in ahi. Amaho chu tutah chun ahung kile uvin ahileh khopi pumpi chun akipapi uva asap u ahi. Hichu ahi achoh jeju achu.  
\v 46 Hiche ban a jong chu laltouna a leng'in atou tan ahi.  
\v 47 Lengpa ding’a panmun nei lamkai ho jouse jong leng David kom'a acheuvin Lengpa chu aga kipapi uvin, 'Na Pathen'in Solomon hi nang sangin minthang jo henlang nang sang'in jong vaihom lenjon hung kijesal johen!' atiuve. Lengpan jong alupna mun achun Pathen janan akunin,  
\v 48 chuleh hiti chun aman 'Israel Pathen chu thangvah in umhen, aman tunin keima hinkho sungin ka mitmu tah in kakhel’a laltouna a touding ei lhenpeh tan ahi,'” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 49 Hichun Adonijah loi le gol ho se-se chu tijatah in anehkhom nau dokhanga kon chun aki thecheh gam jengun ahi.  
\v 50 Adonijah chun Solomon akicha lheh jengin alhaijin muntheng’a maicham saki teni chu aga tuhchah jengin ahi.  
\v 51 Adonijah chun kichatah in maicham a saki teni chu atuh chah jeng e tithu ahung kithang in Leng Solomon in jong ajadoh tan ahi. Hichun Adonijah jong ataovin, “Leng Solomon in eitha louna dingin kihahsel hen!” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 52 Solomon in adonbut in, “Ama kitongkha ponte, ahinla achunga aphatmona aki mudoh leh thi ding ahi,” ati.  
\v 53 Hiti chun Solomon in Adonijah chu akouvin ahileh ama chu maicham a kon'in ama kom apuilut un ahi. Ama jana neitah in Solomon Lengpa ang'a akun in ahileh aman na inlang’a chetan,” atin ahi.   
\c 2  
\s1 David In Solomon Heng’a Lhahna Thu Asei  
\p
\v 1 David lengpa hi a thina ding phat ahung nai phat in aman achapa Solomon chu hiti hin vailhahna ana neijin ahi.   
\p
\v 2 “Keima hi leiset chung’a um mihem jouse phat khat leh ache cheh na diu mun chu kajot ding ahitai. Nangman hangsan tah in pasal phatah umchan hin tho in.  
\v 3 Pakai na Pathen lungdei lam'in hung chon inlang, alampi hinjui jingin, athupeh leh a dan ho Mose Danthu a kisun bang bangin nit jing jengin, chutileh natohna jouse leh na chena jousea na lolhin ding ahi.  
\v 4 Hitia chu nabol leh Pakaijin kei kom'a akitepna jouse chu atohdoh thei ding ahi. Aman ka kom’a eiseipeh chu, 'Nason na chilhah ten alungthim pumpiu leh kitahna neitah a eijui uva ahileh keiman Israel laltouna a khat ka tousah jing ding ahi,' ati.   
\p
\v 5 “Chuleh thil dang khat jong aum’e. Zeruiah chapa Joab in ipi anabol am tichu nahen ahi, aman gal lamkai ni, Ner chapa Abner leh Jether chapa Amasa chu ana that in ahi. Aman gal kisat laiya kithat dan a agel vangin hichu chamna umpet a abol joh ahi bouve, akonggah leh akengkoh chu thisan ana matsah in ahi. \x + \xo 2:5 \xt 2 Samuel 3:27; \xt 2 Samuel 20:10\x*  
\v 6 Hijeh chun ama chung’a hin, phante nati dan dan in hin bolpeh tan, amavang hin lhumsah hih inlang lungmong in alhanmun jotsah hih in.   
\p
\v 7 Gileadna um Barzillai chate chung ah khotona hin musah in, anao chu na ankong ah pan lahsah jengin ajeh chu na sopipa Absalom a konna kajam lai nikho chun aman eina khohsah lheh in ahi. \x + \xo 2:7 \xt 2 Samuel 17:27-29\x*   
\p
\v 8 “Chuleh Bahurim a konna Benjamin phungmi Gera chapa Shimei chu geldoh in. Mahamaim lam’a kajam laijin ama hin nasatah a eina gaosap ahi. Jordan vadunga eilamtoa ahung chun keiman Pakaiya kihahselna kana neijin na that ponge kana tin ahi. \x + \xo 2:8 \xt 2 Samuel 16:5-13; 19:16-23\x*  
\v 9 Ahinlah hiche ka kihahselna chun ama them achansah dehpon ahi. Nangma miching nahin chule iloding le thisan naisan pum'a lhanmun ajot ding alampi hin got them peh tan,” ati.   
\s1 Leng David Thi  
\p
\v 10 David chu athitan David khopia chun apu apate toh akivui khom tauvin ahi.  
\v 11 David chun kum somli vai ana hom in, Hebron ah kum sagi chuleh Jerusalem ah kum somthum le thum vai ana hom in ahi. \x + \xo 2:11 \xt 2 Samuel 5:4,5; 1 Thusimbu 3:4\x*  
\v 12 Solomon chun leng mun ahin lotan apa David laltouna achun ahung tou tan ahi, chuleh a lenggam chu hoitah in akisuhdet tan ahi. \x + \xo 2:12 \xt 1 Thusimbu 29:23\x*   
\s1 Adonijah Thi Le Solomon Leng Vaipoh  
\p
\v 13 Nikhat hi Haggith kitinu chapa Adonijah chu Solomon nu Bathsheba kimupi din ahungin ahi. Bathsheba in, “Chamna lungpua na hung hinam?” ati.  
\p Ama pan jong, “Ahinai, chamna dia kahung ahi.  
\v 14 Tahbeh in keiman na kom'ah thum nom khat kaneije,” ati.  
\p Bathsheba’n jong adonbut in “Ipi ham seijin?” ati.   
\p
\v 15 Adonijah in adonbut in, “Nangin na het bangin hiche lenggam hi keija ding dol ahi, Israel mipite hin lengmun lo dinga kei eideiju ahi. Ahinlah thil ahung kilehei jin hiche lenggam hi ka sopipa ahung chang tai, ajeh chu hiche hi Pakai thilgon ahi.  
\v 16 Hijeh chun tun keiman na kom’a thil khat bou ka thum nom’e, lungset tah in nei it peh hihbeh in” ati.  
\p “Ipiham seijin?” tin Bathsheba in ana dongin ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Aman adonbut in, “Solomon Lengpa kom'ah kei thalheng in thu neihin seipeh in ajeh chu aman na thum-thum chu napeh jeng ding ahi. Shunem nungahnu Abishag khu kaji dingin nei thumpeh in” ati. \x + \xo 2:17 \xt 1 Lgt 1:3,4\x*   
\p
\v 18 Bathsheba in aseijin “Aphai, nangma khelin lengpa hengah nahin thumpeh nang’e,” ati.   
\p
\v 19 Hiti chun Bathsheba chun Leng Solomon kom'ah Adonijah thil thum chu galhut peh dingin achetan ahi. Lengpa chu anu toh kimuto dingin ahung ding doh tan; anu kom a chun agah kunin jana apen ahi. Ama atouna a atoukit chun anu touna ding chu ahin gonpeh diuvin thu apen ajet lang’a chun atousah tan ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Bathsheba in Solomon jah a, “Thumnom thilneo khat kaneijin nei it peh louding kakinem’e,” ati.  
\p Hichun Solomon in, “Ipi ham Henu, seijin ka-itpeh louding nahet chula-em,” ati.   
\p
\v 21 “Achutile na sopipa Adonijah dingin Shunem nungah nu khu petan,” ati.  
\v 22 “Adonijah dinga iti dan a Abishag chu na thum jeng thei ham? Hiche sang a chu, lenggam jeng jong hi nathum jeng leh iti ham! Ama khu ka’u ahi jong nahe in, chuleh Thempu pa Abiathar leh Zeruiah chapa Joab jong ama langa pang ahi nahei,” ati.   
\p
\v 23 Chuin Solomon Lengpa chu Pakai min'in akihahsel in “Adonijah in hiche athil thum hi athipi louleh Pathen'in kei chung'ah akhut lam henlang eithat jeng hen,” ati.  
\v 24 Pakaijin kapa David laltouna a eitousah a eisuhdet peh a, akitepna bang’a ei inchen sah a, hiche Pakai chu hingjing jeng ahi bangin, tuni nikho tah a hi Adonijah thi tei-tei ding ahi!” atin ahi.  
\v 25 Hiti chun Solomon lengpan Jehoiada chapa Benaiah chu athat din thu apen ahile aman jong Adonijah chu athat tai.   
\p
\v 26 Hijou chun lengpan Abiathar Thempu kom'a chun, “Anathoth mun’a na in ah ki nungle tan, nang hi athi dinga lomtah chu nahitai, ahinla tu-tu hin nathat jeng pong’e, ajeh chu nangin kapa David dinga Thaneitah Pakai Thingkhong chu naput peh in chuleh ahahsatna jouse na-na thoh khompi in ahi,” ati. \x + \xo 2:26 \xt 2 Samuel 15:24; \xt 1 Samuel 22:20-23\x*  
\v 27 Hiti chun Solomon in Abiathar chu Pakai Thempu panmun a kon'in a haisah in, hiti chun Pakaijin Shiloh a Eli chilhah te chung chang Pakai thu phondoh chu a lolhin sah in ahi. \x + \xo 2:27 \xt 1 Samuel 2:27-36\x*   
\p
\v 28 Joab hin Absalom doubolna a chu ana panpi lou vangin Adonijah doubolna joh chu ana panpin ahi. Hitia hi Adonijah thi thu hi ajah phat in Pakai ponbuh munthenga maicham saki teni chu aga tuhtan tan ahi.  
\v 29 Hiche hi Solomon Lengpa kom'a ahetsah phat un, aman Jehoiada chapa Benaiah chu athat din asol tan ahi.   
\p
\v 30 Benaiah chu Pakai ponbuh munthenga chun achen Joab kom'a chun “Hiche mun a kon chun hungdoh in Leng thupeh ahi!” atin ahi.  
\p Ahinlah Joab in adonbut in, “Hungdoh pong’e hikom'ah thiden tang’e” ati.  
\p Hijeh chun Benaiah chu ahung kilen Joab thusei chu lengpa kom'ah aseipeh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 31 “Ama seibang chun boltan” ati. Lengpan, “Maicham munna chun hin thatdoh inlang hin vuitan. Hichun Joab in ajeh beija thisan asona ho chu kei leh kapa insung ah themmona hin sutheng tan te.  
\v 32 Ama sanga phajo le chonphajo chuleh kitahjo mini athana phu chu Pakaijin lethuh nante, ajeh chu aman Israel sepai te lamkai Ner chapa Abner leh Judah sepai te lamkai Jether chapa amasa atha chu kapa’n ana hetphah lou ahi.  
\v 33 Athisan phu chu Joab leh ason apah ho chungah atonsot in chu jeng hen lang amavang David leh a chilhah chung leh alaltouna chungah atonsot in Pakaijin chamna pejing tahen,” ati.   
\p
\v 34 Hichun Jehoiada chapa Benaiah chu achekit in ponbuh theng maicham mun achun Joab chu athat in, chule gammang lam a ainmun'a chun ahin vuitan ahi.  
\v 35 Hijou chun lengpan Benaiah chu Joab khel in sepai lamkaijin apansah tan, chuleh Abiathar khel in Zadok chu thempu in apansah tan ahi.   
\p
\v 36 Chuin lengpan Shimei chu aga kousah in aseipeh tan ahi, “Jerusalem ahin in kisah inlang cheng tan. Ahinla hiche khopia konna hin mun chom’a potdoh hih in.  
\v 37 Nangin Kidron phaicham nahin khokhel pou-pou le hiche nikho ni leh nathi tei-tei ding ahi, chule hiche na thisan phu chu nangma le nangman nakipoh ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 38 Shimei in, “Na thutan chu adih e; ken jong kapu lengpan nasei dungjuiya ka chon ding ahitai,” ati. Hiti chun Shimei chu Jerusalem ah phat sottah achengin ahi.   
\p
\v 39 Ahin kum thum jouvin asoh teni ajamdoh lhon'in Gath khoa Maacah chapa Achisah kom'ah ajamlut lhon tan ahi, Shimei in aum na lhon ahet doh phat in,  
\v 40 sangan chung ah atoudoh in asoh teni hol in Gath ah achen aga holdoh in amu phat in Jerusalem ah ahin puilut kit tai.   
\p
\v 41 Solomon chun Shimei in Jerusalem a dalhan apotdoh in Gath aga pha in ahung kile kit tai tin aja tan ahi.  
\v 42 Hijeh chun lengpan Shimei chu aga kousah in, “Keiman nangma hi na potdoh louhel ding na potdoh pou-pou leh na thi tei-tei ding ahi tia Pakai minna ka kitep sah nahi lou ham? Hiche a chun nangin jong na thutan chu adih e, 'Nasei dungjuiya ka chon ding ahi' nati hilou ham?  
\v 43 Ahileh tua hi nangin ibol’a nangin ka thupeh nit ding’a Pakai minna na kitepna nanit lou ham?” atitan ahi.   
\p
\v 44 Lengpan Shemei kom'ah aseiben, “Nangin kapa David chung’a thil gilou tah na-na bol chu na geldoh em? Pakaijin na thilse bol chu na luchung’a chuh sah tahen.  
\v 45 Ahinlah keima Leng Solomon in Pakai phatthei boh chu mu jing ingting chuleh David son khat Pakai anga laltouna a hin tou jeng hen” ati.  
\v 46 Hichun lengpan thu apeh dungjuijin Jehoiada chapa Benaiah in Shimei chu polang’a apuidoh in athat tai.  
\p Hiti hin lenggam chu Solomon khut noi ah a detchet tan ahi.   
\c 3  
\s1 Solomon In Chihna Athum  
\p
\v 1 Solomon in Egypt lengpa Pharaoh toh kinoptona khat anei lhon'in achanu ho lah a khat akichen pi’n ahi. Aman lah leng inpi, Pakai Hou-In asah chai loulai jeh leh Jerusalem kimvel pal akiget chai loulai jeh in ajinu chu David khopia apuilut in achenpi’n ahi.  
\v 2 Hiche pet chun Pakai min dopsangna ding’a Hou-In akisah chai loulai jeh in, Israel mipi ten ama-ama mun cheh ah pumgo thilto akisem un ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Solomon in Pakai angailun chule apa David thupeh ho jouse chu ajui sohkei jin, chujongleh ama jengin jong pumgo thilto kilhaina ahin gimnamtui halnamna ahin ama deina lai-lai mun ah anabol jin ahi.  
\v 4 Hitobang’a Pathen houna mun thupi pen chu Gibeon ahi, hiche ahin achen pumgo thilto 1,000 jenin kilhaina agasem in ahi.  
\v 5 Hiche jan chun Pakai chu Solomon kom'ah amangin ana kilah in Pathen'in aseijin ahi, “Ipi na dei ham? Thum'in nape ing kate!” ati.   
\p
\v 6 Solomon in adonbut in, “Nangin na sohpa kapa David kitah tah in na ngailun ahi, ajeh chu aman nangma lungtheng tah le thudih tah in, chuleh kitahna neitah in na-na jui jingin ahi. Chuleh nangin alaltouna lo thei ding chapa khat napen kitah tah in na-na ngailu’n ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Tun, O Pakai ka Pathen, kapa David khel in leng nei chansah tan ahi, ahinla keima hi imacha helou chapang cha kahi bouvin ahi.  
\v 8 Hiti hin keima hi na milhen tum nam lentah le sim joulou mi tamtah te lah a kaum'in ahi.  
\v 9 Hijeh chun hitobang nam mite chung’a hi ka vaihom jouna ding leh thil adih leh adihlou ka hetkhen them theina dingin lungthim chihna neipen. Ajeh chu koiham ama changa hiche mipite hijat lah a hi vaihom jou ding ah?” ati.   
\p
\v 10 Pakai chu Solomon in chihna athum chu akipapi lheh in ahi.  
\v 11 Hijeh chun, Pathen'in adonbut in, “Na gal mite thigam na ding le, haona ding ahilouleh hinkho sotna ding thum louva ka mite chung’a thudih tah a na vaihopna ding’a lungthim chihna na thum jeh in,  
\v 12 Keiman nathum chu nape ing katin, hetthem theina lungthim leh koimacha dangin ana nei khahlou khonung jongleh ahin nei khah louding chihna kapeh ding nahi.  
\v 13 Chuleh nangin na thum loubeh haona leh minthanna jong kapeh ding nahi! Hitia chu leiset chung’a hi na hinkho lhumkeija leng dang koimacha toh tekahpi thei nahi louding ahi.  
\v 14 Chuleh napa David bang’a ka danthu leh ka thupeh ho nanit a najui bukim soh leh hinkho sotna jong kapeh ding nahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 15 Hichun Solomon ahung thou in ahileh amang ahi ahin hedoh in ahi. Hichun ama Jerusalem ah akilen Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong masanga chun adingin pumgo thilto ho leh chamna thilto kilhaina asemin chuleh ama ding’a panmun neiho jouse akoukhom in ankong loupitah asemin ahi.   
\s1 Solomon In Chingthei Tah A Thu Atan  
\p
\v 16 Chomkhat jouvin numei kijoh ni lengpa kom'ah aboina thu lhon atanpeh dingin ahung lhon'in ahi.  
\v 17 Khat joh nu chun, “Nei lungset in, kapu, hiche nu hitoh inkhat a kachen khom lhon ahin, ama toh inkhat a kaum khom lhon pet in keiman cha khat ka hingin ahi.  
\v 18 Nithum jouvin hichenu jong hin cha khat ahingin ahi. Hiche in a hi koimacha dang umlou, keini chang bou kaum lhon ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Ahin jan in amanu chun acha chu ana dellih tan ahi.  
\v 20 Hijou chun ama janin a thoudoh in keima ka imut pet in ka panga lum ka chapa chu ana kipom doh in, ama cha athisa chu keima anga ana koijin kei cha chu ana kidop doh in aluppi tan ahi.  
\v 21 Jingkah langin ka cha chu nao an kavah kigot leh athisa ana hitai! Ahin keiman jingkah lam khovah a kagah vetchil’a ahileh hichu ka chapa anahi tapoi,” ati.   
\p
\v 22 Hichun numei khat nu chun ahin pal tan in, “Hiche nangma cha ahin ahing joh chu kei cha ahi,” ati.  
\p Numei amasa nu chun, “Ahipoi, ahing joh chu kei cha ahin, athi chu nang’a joh ahi,” atipeh in, hiti hin Lengpa masanga chun achuti kinel lhon tan ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Hichun Lengpan, “Aphai atah chu veu hite, na ni lhon'in naosen ahing joh chu keiya ahi nati lhon'in, athi a chu ama a joh ahi nati lhon’e.  
\v 24 Aphai, chemjam hin choi un,” ati. Hichun ama hon chemjam chu Lengpa kom'ah ahin choi tauve.   
\p
\v 25 Hichun aman aseitai, “Naosen ahing joh chu bohni souvin lang ani lhon chun hoppeh tauvin!” ati.   
\p
\v 26 Hichun, naosen ahing joh anu mong-mong nu chun, Naosen chu a-it behseh in ahung peng jah tai, “Oh Lengpa, chuti ponte that hih in, chapang chu amanu joh petauvin!” ahin titai. Ahin khatnu chun ahin seijin, “Aphai, nangla changlou keila changlou kani lhon'in nei hop peh tauvin!” ati.   
\p
\v 27 Hichun Lengpan ahin seijin, “Naosen chu that hih un, ahin ding deinu chu petauvin ama chu anu tah-tah ahi!” ati.   
\p
\v 28 Israel mipi ten lengpa thutan chu ajah doh phat un, lengpa chu a kicha tauve, ajeh chu Pathen'in thu dihtah a thutan thei dinga chihna apeh ahi ti amudoh tauvin ahi.   
\c 4  
\s1 Solomon Lenggam'a Vaipo Ho  
\p
\v 1 Solomon Lengpa Israel mite ho jouse chunga vai ana hom in ahi,  
\v 2 Hiti chun ama ding’a vaihom a pang ho jouse chu hicheng hi ahiuve:  
\b  
\li1 Zadok chapa Azariah chu thempun apangin ahi.   
\li1
\v 3 Shisha chapa teni Elihoreph leh Ahijah chu lekha sun in apang lhon'in ahi.  
\li1 Ahilud chapa Jehosaphat chu thusimbu chingin apangin ahi.   
\li1
\v 4 Jehoiada chapa Benaiah chu sepai te lamkaijin apang in ahi.  
\li1 Zadok le Abiathar chu Thempun apang lhon'e.   
\li1
\v 5 Chujongleh Azariah kitipa Nathan chapa chu Gambeh gamvaipo ho jouse chunga vaihom in apang’e.  
\li1 Nathan themgao chapa Zabud chu lengpa thumop in apang in ahi.   
\li1
\v 6 Ahishar chu leng inpi thilkeoho vengtup in apangin ahi.  
\li1 Abda chapa Adoniram chu soh natonga kimang ho vetup in apang in ahi.   
\b  
\p
\v 7 Solomon in Israel pumpia thunei dingin gambeh vaipo som le ni ana koiyin ahi. Amaho hin leng insung’a neh le chah ho jouse asuhtup jing diu ahi. Amaho khat cheh chun kum khat sung’a lha khat cheh ading amopoh diu ahi.  
\v 8 Hiche gamvaipo som le ni ho min chu hiche ho hi ahiuve:  
\b  
\li1 Ephraim thinglhang cheng ho dia, Ben-hur.   
\li1
\v 9 Makaz, Shaalbim, Beth-shemesh leh Elon-bethhanan ho adia, Bendeker hin apoh ahi.   
\li1
\v 10 Ben-hased in Arubboth leh Socoh chuleh Hepher gam jong apoh ahi.   
\li1
\v 11 Ben-abinadab in Naphoth-dor. (Ama hin Solomon chanu khat Taphath kitinu chu akichenpi ahi).   
\li1
\v 12 Ahilud chapa Baana in Taanach le Magiddo, Jezreel noiya um Zerethan kom'a Bethshan pumpi apon, chuleh Bethshan apat Abel-meholah kikah gam pumpi Jokmeam chung lang jong apon ahi.   
\li1
\v 13 Ben-geber in Ramoth-gilead le Gilead na Jair khopi ho pum in apon (Jair kiti hi Manasseh phung ahi), chuleh Bashan a Argob gamkol jong apon, chuleh sum-eng kelkot kiget khum leh kulpi kikai khum khopi lentah cheh somgup jong apohtha’n ahi.   
\li1
\v 14 Iddo chapa Ahinadab in Mahanaim apon ahi.   
\li1
\v 15 Ahimaaz in Naphtali apon (Ama hin Solomon chanu lah a khat Basemath chu akichen pin ahi).   
\li1
\v 16 Hushai chapa Banna in Asher leh Aloth apon ahi.   
\li1
\v 17 Paruah chapa Jehoshaphat in Issachar apon ahi.   
\li1
\v 18 Ela chapa Shimei in Benjamin apon ahi.   
\li1
\v 19 Uri chapa Geber in Gilead gam leh Amor mite leng Sihon gam leh Bashan leng Og gam jong ahop ahi.  
\li1 Judah gam pumpia gam vaipo khat jong ana koiyin ahi.   
\s1 Solomon Phattheina Le Chihna  
\p
\v 20 Judah leh Israel te hi twikhanglen pang’a neldi jat apha jengun ahi. Amaho hi neh le chah ijakai jong anengchet jengun ahi.  
\v 21 Solomon hin sahlang gam Euphrates vadung apat lenggam jouse ahin, lhanglam gamkai Egypt gamgichin a konna Philistine te gam gei aboncha chunga hi alengvai apoh ahi. Gam kilokhum mite a konin Solomon jabolnan sum athot un ahinkho sungin ajen jingun ahi. \x + \xo 4:21 \xt Semtilbu 15:18; 2 Thusimbu 9:26\x*   
\p
\v 22 Solomon Leng inpi’a nikhat neh le chah ding chu changbong neldisel atena 150 leh aneh a tena 300,  
\v 23 chuleh bongchal thao cheh 10, hamhing lah a kivah thao chet bong 20 leh kelngoi 100, hicheng lah a hi sakhi chal ho leh sangan ho jong ki simtha loulai chuleh sakhigol ho leh ahchal thaotah ho jong kisimtha lou ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Ajeh chu Solomon hin Eupharates lhumlam gamsung, Tiphsah apat Gaza geija vaipoh thaneina anei ahi. Chule akigamgitpi jouse chutoh chamnan akhosa uve.  
\v 25 Solomon damlai sungin Judah le Israel sung pumpi sung’a hin chamna leh bitna ana um'in ahi. Chuleh sahlanga Dan gam apat lhanglam Sheba geijin min ama-ama in le lou mongtah in ana neijun ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Solomon'in a kangtalai ho koina ding 4,000 jen aneijin chuleh sakol jong 12,000 aneiye. \x + \xo 4:26 \xt 1 Lgt 10:26; 2 Thusimbu 1:14; 9:25\x*   
\p
\v 27 Gambeh vaipo hon kitah tah le lolhing tah in Solomon Lengpa le leng inpia anneh twidon avat umlou hellin, aneh jing theina diuvin ama-ama kingensena dungjui cheh in atong doh jingun ahi.  
\v 28 Hiche chungchon ahin ama hon sakol chang leh changpol jong sakol ho neh dingin ah akoi neng jingun ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Pathen'in Solomon chu chihna le hetthem theina twikhanglen pang’a neldi jat apen ahi.  
\v 30 Tahbeh in achihna hin solam gamkaija miching ho jouse leh Egypt gamsung’a miching jouse akhokhel in ahi.  
\v 31 Ama chihna hin midang jouse akhel in Ezrah mi Ethan sang'in jong aching jon, Mahol chapa te Heman le Calcol chule Darda ho sang'in jong gamchengin aching jon ahi. Aminthan na hin avel’a mite ho jouse a khokhel in ahi. \x + \xo 4:31 \xt Labu 89\x*  
\v 32 Aman thuchih 3,000 leh la 1,005 ana sem in ahi. \x + \xo 4:32 \xt Thuchihbu 1:1; 10:1; 25:1; Solomon Labu 1:1\x*  
\v 33 Aman thingphung ho thudol, Lebanon gam a Cedar thingho, pal khekeh kah chung dunga kehthei hyssop hamhing neoho chan geijin jong ana seitheije. Aman gamsaho thudol, vachate thudol ahin, a-op a kithol tho ho thudol ahin chule nga ho thudol jengin jong ana sei sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 34 Leiset chunga lengho jousen athusei aja uvin chuleh athusei ngai dingin palai ho asol uvin ahi.   
\c 5  
\s1 Hou-In Sahna Dia Kigotna  
\p
\v 1 Tyre Lengpa Hiram hi David dinga gol phatah ana hijing’a ahi. David chapa Solomon chu Israel te leng ahitai ti ahet phat in palai asol in akipapina thu chu aga lhutsah in ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Hichun Hiram kom'ah Solomon in thu alethot in ahi.   
\b  
\pmo
\v 3 “Kapa David chun Pakai a Pathen min dopsang na dinga a Hou-In tundoh ding chu ana jou tapoi ti nahiuve, ajeh chu aman avel’a gal mite toh gal kisattona a ana kimang chan ahi. Pathen'in ama hi gal mite ajosah soh kahsea Hou-In ana sah joulou ahi.  
\v 4 Ahin tunvang Pakai ka Pathen'in gamsung pumpia hin chamna eipe tan, tuhin galmi kanei tapon eihin suboi ding jong kanei tapon ahi.  
\v 5 Pakaijin kapa David kom'ah, nangma ban a Leng’a ka hin tun ding na chapa chun kei dinga Hou-In eihin sahpeh ding ahi. Hijeh chun Pakai ka Pathen jabolna ding’a Hou-In khat sah dingin lunggel lhuhna kanei tan ahi. \x + \xo 5:5 \xt 2 Samuel 7:12,13; 1 Thusimbu 17:11,12\x*   
\pm
\v 6 Hijeh chun Lebanon ah kei dinga Cedar thing eihung phuh peh dingin na mite hinsol inlang ka miten jong amaho chu tohkhom piuvin tin chuleh nangma dei dungjuijin atohman’u penang’e. Ajeh chu nami ten thing phuhje ahet bangun keima miten ahe pouve ti nahetsa ahi,” atin ahi.   
\b  
\p
\v 7 Solomon thuthot chu ajah phat in Hiram chu akipah lheh jengin, hitin aseiye: “Hitobang nam thupitah chung’a ama banna Leng chang dinga David chapa ching tah hinpe’a Pakai chu thangvah in umhen!”  
\v 8 Hichun Hiram in Solomon chu thu athot in:  
\b  
\pmo “Nahin thuthot chu kana mu’n, na ngaichat bang’a Cedar thing le chahthing bim ho kahin peh ding ahi.  
\v 9 Ka miten thingtum ho chu Lebanon mol ho apat Mediterranean Twikhanglen geijin alomin hin tolsuh untin chuleh nangin nadei nalai twipanga chu ahin tol suh diu ahi. Chujou teng ka miten lhamlha untin chuleh na mite khut a ahin pohlut ding’u ahi. Chutengleh ka insung'a neh ding nahin peh ding kadeije,” ati.   
\b  
\p
\v 10 Hiti chun Hiram in Solomon chu Cedar leh chahthing angaichat chan ahin pen ahi.  
\v 11 Chuleh Solomon'in Hiram mite neh dingin suhlou chang atena dim 100,000 leh thaotwi kihehlhasa atena dim 110,000 apen ahi. Solomon in thil hijat hi kumseh a Hiram apeh jing ahi.  
\v 12 Pakaijin akitepna bang bangin Solomon chu chihna apen, Solomon leh Hiram kah ajong pankhom jingna dingin kigahna anasem lhon'in ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Solomon in Israel mipi jouse lah a kon'in mi 30,000 natong dingin ana sem'in ahi.  
\v 14 Amaho hi mi 10,000 Lebanon langa asol jin, lhakhat sungin Lebanon a na agatong jiuvin chuleh lhani sung chu in’a ahung kicholdo jiuvin ahi. Hichea natongho vesui dingin Adoniram ana pansah in ahi. \x + \xo 5:14 \xt 1 Lgt 12:18\x*  
\v 15 Solomon in thinglhang gamsung’a jong thilgih pole dingin mihem sang somsagi; song kheng them jong mihem 80,000 aneijin,  
\v 16 natong ho vesui dingin lamkai 3,600 ana pansah in ahi.  
\v 17 Lengpa thupeh dungjuijin, songlentah tah le song guntah tah ho chu akheng toh-un Hou-In bul kitundohna a dingin ana mangun ahi.  
\v 18 Gebal khopi miten Solomon akithopi uvin chuleh Hiram insathem hon Hou-In song le thing ding agon peh un ahi.   
\c 6  
\s1 Solomon'in Hou-In asah  
\p
\v 1 Israel chaten Egypt gam ahin dalhah kal kum 480 lhin kum, Israel te chung’a Solomon leng vaipoh jou kumli lhin kum, lhani lhinna Ziv lhasung in Solomon chun Hou-In sahna ding natoh apan tan ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Solomon Lengpan Pakai Hou-In dinga asah chu adung feet 90, avai feet 30 ahin chule asan dan chu feet 45 ahiye.  
\v 3 Hongcha kihoi chu feet 30 in asaovin a invai chutoh akibange, chuleh a inmai lam chu feet 15 in asao in ahi.  
\v 4 Solomon in Hou-In bangkot tampi akihoijin, insunglam sangin apolam aneojep in ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Inbang kimvel leh inbang lhung keija kigol phei dingin doson asemin, alailung leh muntheng dan sungnung kimvel geijin jong doson asempeh in chuleh jet le veija jong indan khat cheh akidoi.  
\v 6 Dan noinungpen chu feet 7-1/2, dan lailha chu feet 9 alhing in, danthum lhinna chu feet 10-1/2 ahin indou injol chengse chu insunga akithollut pai louna dingin in polam achun kalbi lei akido touvin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Hou-In sahna dia kimang songho akilaidohna mun'a kisuitoh tohsa ahin, hijeh chun Hou-In kisahlai sungsen jong sehcha kivopoh ham heicha kitupoh ham ahilouleh thih manchah kimanga kivopoh husan imacha akijadoh poi.   
\p
\v 8 Indan noinungpen lutna ding’a kihoi kot chu bang lhanglam'ah akihoijin, miho chu akimlaija konna kalbi leija kaltouva chujou tengleh adan lailha a konna chu dan thum lhinna a chu kaltou ahiye.  
\v 9 Hiti hin Solomon in Hou-In chu ana san asa joutai, chuleh bichingdal dingin thinglhon ho leh Cedar thing khunpeh ho chu amangin ahi.  
\v 10 Akiseima bang chun, aman indan thum chu kijopmat cheh, dan khat chu feet 7-1/2 cheh asangin, Hou-In polam bang to kinga toa kisem ahin, cedar thinglhon a kijopmat cheh ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Pakaijin Solomon henga thu ahin seijin,  
\v 12 “Hiche Hou-In nasah chung’a hi, nangin ka danthu ho leh ka thupeh ho chengse nanit sohkeija ahileh keiman napa David kom'a kana kitepna chu nang chunga hi ka tohdoh ding ahi.  
\v 13 Keima Israel te lah a kachen ding Israel mipite hi ka nungsun louhel ding ahi,” ati.   
\s1 Hou-In Asunglam  
\p
\v 14 Hiti hin Solomon chun Hou-In chu asa chai tan ahi.  
\v 15 Hou-In sunga abang jouse, atol’a pat abiching geiyin cedar thingpeh in atomjol sohkeijin, alhong jong chahthingpeh apha in atomjol sohkeiyin ahi,  
\v 16 Aman insung dan, Muntheng Chungnungpen kiti lai chu Hou-In tomlam a kisem ahin, atol’a pat abiching geiya feet 30 sao, cedar thingpeh a kigen tan ahi. \x + \xo 6:16 \xt Potdohbu 26:33,34\x*  
\v 17 Muntheng Chungnung masanga um, Hou-In inpi chufeet 60 in asaovin ahi.  
\v 18 Insunga asong bang ho jouse chu Cedar thingpeh in phate chan akitomjol sohkeijin, chule umga leng tobang leh pahcha pahlha ding kon banga kijempol ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Aman indan sungnung langa chun Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong koina dingin indan theng khat asembe in ahi.  
\v 20 Hiche indantheng sung chu feet 30 in asaovin, feet 30 ma alen'in, feet 30 ma asang'in ahi. Dantheng sung apumpi chu sana thengsel in atomjol sohkeijin, chuleh Cedar thinga kisem maicham phung jong chu sana in atomjol sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 21 Chule Solomon in indan sung aumpi chun sana thengselin atomjol sohkeiyin ahi, dantheng chungnung pen lutna maija chun sana gui teni ajam pelton, sana maman atomjol in ahi.  
\v 22 Hiti chun Hou-In sung pumpi chule Muntheng sungnunga maicham jong apumpin sana jengin atomjol in ahi. \x + \xo 6:22 \xt Potdohbu 30:1-3\x*   
\p
\v 23 Muntheng chungnung laiya hin olive thinga kisem cherub vantil lhaving ni nei limni akisem in, khat cheh chu feet 15 asang'in ahi. \x + \xo 6:23 \xt Potdohbu 25:18-20\x*  
\v 24 Cherub vantil khat cheh chu alhajah feet 15 cheh asaovin, alha teni chu feet 7-1/2 sao cheh ahi.  
\v 25 Cherub teni chu aletdan jong aneo dan jong akibang gel in, chule agongso jong thakhat chet ahi lhon'e.  
\v 26 Cherub teni chu ani lhon'in asandan feet 15 alhing cheh lhon e.  
\v 27 Aman cherub teni chu indan sung langpeh a atung in, alha lhon akijal sohkeijin cherub khat lhaving chun bang lang khat aphan, chutengleh alha langkhat gel lhon chu alaija alhaving le alhaving akitongkhato lhon'in ahi.  
\v 28 Solomon in cherub vantil teni jong chu sana’n atom jolsel jengin ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Indan lenpa bang jouse indan sungnung bang jouse chu cherub vantil lim le tumthing lim chule pahcha lim jengin akijempol in ahi.  
\v 30 Alhong ho jeng jong chu asung apo kibangin sana jengin atomjol in ahi.   
\p
\v 31 Muntheng sungnung lutna dingin Solomon chun olive thing jengin kotpi asem sohkeijin, kot chunga ajolpa leh akotpi khom chengse chu agomin nga jen alhinge.  
\v 32 Kotpi teni chu cherub lim le tumthing lim chule pahcha lim akisem in ahi. Kotpi ahin chule lim kisem ho ahin abonchan sanan atomjol sohkeijin, cherub vantil lim kisem ho leh tumthing lim kisemho chunga jong chun sanatwi athe khumin ahi.   
\p
\v 33 Hou-In kimlai lunga lutna ding kotpi khomho jong chu aningli noija Olive thing jeng’a kisem ahin, hitobang bang hin asemin ahi.  
\v 34 Chahthing a kisem kotpi ni alhing in, kotpi khatna ajet aveija kotpeh teni chu akilhep thei gel ahi, chu tobangma chun kotpi khatpa jong ajet aveija akotpi teni akilhep thei cheh in ahi.  
\v 35 Akotpeh chung dunga chun cherub lim le tumthing lim chule pahcha lim jeng jengin ajempol sohkeije. Chuleh abonchan sana’n atom gel in, akijopna dung gei jong sana aloival sohkeijin ahi.   
\p
\v 36 Hou-In lailung alhong chu song khensa gol thum'in asen chule Cedar thing inkam adatna din golkhat in ajambe nalaiye.   
\p
\v 37 Solomon leng chan kumli channa Ziv lhasung in Pakai Hou-In chu akhombul ana tung doh pan tauvin ahi.  
\v 38 Solomon Leng chan kum som le khat channa ‘Bul’ kiti lha sung hin Hou-In sahna dinga ana kigkonna dungjui bang tah in ana kijou chaisoh tauvin ahi. Hiti chun hiche Hou-In sahna ahin kum sagi ana lut in ahi.   
\c 7  
\s1 Solomon'in Aleng Inpi Asah  
\p
\v 1 Solomon'in ama in ding mong-mongin leng inpi khat ana tungdoh in hiche asahna ahin kum som le thum ana lut in ahi.   
\p
\v 2 A insah khat chu Lebanon Gammang Leng Inpi tin amin ana sah in ahi. Hichu adung feet 150, avai feet 75, atun feet 45 ahi. Akisah dan chu Cedar thing khompi golli kigolla, hiche Cedar thingkhom chunga chu Cedar ma-ma inkam a kijam cheh ahi.  
\v 3 Kikhopna indan chung chu Cedar thinga kikhu ahi. Khompi ho chunga Cedar inkam kijam ho chunga chun indan kijommat somli le nga aum'in hiche ho khat-khat chun indan som le nga a kihom khen cheh kit ahi.  
\v 4 Golthum thum cheh a chun, bangkot chu thum chengin khat le khat aki angngat tocheh in akigolphei jin ahi.  
\v 5 Kotpi ho jouse le bangkot ho jouse chun, ningli cheh aneijun bangkot thum ahi in akingato cheh un ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Solomon in jong khompi jeng kiphut kikhopna inkhat jong asan, hiche in asao dan chu feet 75 alhing in chule availam feet 45 alhing in ahi, hiche maiya chun hongcha khat akisem in chule tumpi khat jong akitunge.   
\p
\v 7 Solomon chun Thutanna In tia kihe vaipohna ding In khat jong asan, hiche mun'a chu lenggam sunga thilsoh ho chunga thutan in ana toujin ahi. Hiche in hi alhong’a pat abiching geija Cedar thing jeng’a kitomjol soh ahi.  
\v 8 Hiche in anunglam a chu Solomon in ama chenna ding mongin adang ho asah bang-bang chun akisah in ahi. Aman akichenpi Pharaoh chanu ding jong chu hiche in tobang khatma ana sahpeh in ahi. \x + \xo 7:8 \xt 1 Lgt 3:1\x*   
\p
\v 9 Akhombul kitundohna pat a chu kikhuna chan gei a hi songmantam tamtah tah leh lentah tah a adung avai kitohchetna kikheng, songtholna a kitholnal cheh a aninglia ki-at tohchet ahi.  
\v 10 Akhombul kitunna songlentah ho chu abang feet 15 asaovin, chule abang feet 12 in asaovin ahi.  
\v 11 Abaang kisemna a kimang song manlutah tah le lentah tah ho chu kitohchet a ki-at ngen ahin, chule Cedar thingho jong ajol in akimang in ahi.  
\v 12 Indan lhonglaija chun akimvel lhumkeijin song khentohsa golthum'in akigolin chule Cedar thing inkam bangin golkhat in akigolin, Pakai Hou-In bang sungnung leh lutna kot ho banga kibol sohkei ahi.   
\s1 Hou-In Kijephoi  
\p
\v 13 Solomon Lengpan Hiram kitipa chu Tyre a konna hung dingin ahil in ahi.  
\v 14 Hiram hi Israel mi Naphtali phunga konna meithai khat cha ahin, apa hi Tyre a konna sum-eng khengthem mi ahi. Ama chu sum-eng khenna lama thepgilna le boltheina thilpeh chang’a ahin, ama chu ahungin Solomon lengpa dingin thih natohna lam jouse tohpeh dingin apang tan ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Hiram in sum-eng a kisem khompi ni jen aphut in, khompi khat cheh chu asan dan fett 27 alhing’e, akhom kolkimvel chu feet 18 ahi.  
\v 16 Hiche aman feet 7-1/2 a sang khom lujum ni akhengin, khompi teni chunga tun dingin sum-eng kilhajol maman asemin ahi.  
\v 17 Khompi jouse luvuma jopna dingin sum-eng gui kipheh bangin ni apheh in akijem in ahi.  
\v 18 Chujongleh aman khompi ho jep hoina dingin, kolbuthei pah lim golni jong asemin, ana jemin ahi.  
\v 19 Khomlujum lutna asunglam chu lily pahcha lim tobangin akijemin, chule asan chu feet gup a sao cheh in ahi.  
\v 20 Khompi lujum kisem teni chu chunga kolbuthei pah jani golni in akigol kimvellin, aning langah chun lencha pheh banga kipheh sum-eng gui kiveina kom'a chun akitat doh e.  
\v 21 Chuin khopi chengse chu Hou-In hongcha a atungdoh pai-paijin, lhanglam ajong khompi khat aphutdoh in amin Jakin asah e, chutengleh sahlam'a jong khompi khatma aphutdoh kit in amin Boaz asah in ahi.  
\v 22 Khompi teni chungvum achun lily pahcha jem akisem in, hiti hin khompi kibol chu akichai soh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Hiram in sum-enga kisem twikong lenpi khat alhan, agei langkhat apat alanggei chan chu feet 15 alhing in, hichu twikhanglen in asah in ahi. Athuh dan feet 7-1/2 ahin chule akollvel pumpi chu feet 45 alhing in ahi.  
\v 24 Akonggei noigol’a chun umtam lim tampi gol ni in akijemphei peh in, chule feet khat sung in hiche umtam lim chu gup tobang aum'in, twikong akilhajolpet a chu hichengse chutoh kilhah tha ahitai.   
\p
\v 25 Twikong chu sum-enga kisem bongchal som le ni chunga akiluijin, hiche bongchal ho jouse chun polam angat cheh u ahi. Hiti chun, bongchal thum'in sahlam anga in, bongchal thumma in lhanglam angan, bongchal thumma in lhanglam angan chuleh bongchal thum'in nisolam anga in, hiche twikong chu bongchal te chung’a hi kiluija ahi.  
\v 26 Twikong sa dan chu inche thum ahin, agei jong khon gei kisempeh banga kisem ahin, pahcha pah bangin akisem in atwikong chun twi tena 11,000 jen adol’e.   
\p
\v 27 Hiram in jong sum-eng kangtalai som asemin; chule hiche kangtalai khat chu feet 6 asaovin, feet 6 ma alenin, chule feet 4-1/2 in asang'in ahi.  
\v 28 Hiche kangtalai ho chu kolbem a kisem ahin chule amaitom cheh aneiyun, hiche amai tom cheh u chu akolsunga kitung cheh ahi.  
\v 29 Hiche kangtalai kol sung dung’a kihenglut hiche amai tom dung’a hin sakei bahkai lim le bongchal lim chule cherub lim tampi akisem in ahi. Akol chung le anoi dunga chun keipi bahkai le bongchal lim kisemhon akijem in ahi.  
\v 30 Kangtalai khat cheh chun sum-enga kisem kang li cheh leh sum-eng jol li cheh anei uve. Aninglia chun twikong tunna ding sum-eng khom li akiphut cheh in, hiche akhom ho jong hi ajet aveija pahcha lim toh kilhah tha cheh ahiuve.  
\v 31 Kangtalai chungvuma chun kisilna kong sin ding abem khat akikoiyin, aki hondoh’a ahileh chunglam angan, athuh dan chu feet athuh e, akihondohna akam chu abem in, khom tunlutna ding’a kisem ahijeh chun feet 2-1/4 athuh in ahi. Akihonna a jong chun pahcha akisem in, amai tomna jong aning li noija kibol ahin, abem poi.  
\v 32 Akangho chu kangtalai kang tobang ahin, Sum-eng chaokol li chu amai tomna noija chun akibat in, chuleh chaokol sunga kithilpai sum-eng jol chengse chu akhom todal chengse chutoh tikhat bangin aum uve, chaokol khat cheh chu a sandol feet 2-1/4 alhinge.  
\v 33 Hiche chaokol ho hi kangtalai velkol ho tobang’a khu kisem cheh ahiuvin, ajolpi a pangho ahin, avel tomna ahin, ajolpi kah a kipheh thihjang ho ahin, chule alaija athihjang jouse kisuhtona avel bem ahin aboncha akilhahjol tho jeng ahiuve.   
\p
\v 34 Khom todal khat cheh achun aning lia akingapna ding li cheh aum in, akingapna chengse le akhom todal chengse jong chu tikhat tobang bang ahiuve.  
\v 35 Khom todal chunga chun akol a kivei khat khao tobangin aum in, tongkeh khat ahung sang doh e, chutengleh khom todal chunga akibuna ding leh amai tomna ho jong chu likhat bangin akisem thai.  
\v 36 Akibuna ding amai dung le amai tomna dunga jong chun aman cherub lim ho leh keipi bahkai lim semnan chule tumthing limho semnan amangin, adol le adollou dungjuijin asomin, akimvel’a chun pahcha jeng asem peh in ahi.  
\v 37 Chujouvin hitobang asemchai soh phat in akhom todal som asemin aboncha chu kibang cheh a kilhajol ahin, alet le aneo jong aki bangin alim le agong jong akibang cheh e.   
\p
\v 38 Kisilna ding jong sum-eng kong somkhat asemin kisilna kongkhat cheh chun twi tena 220 adolin, kisilna kongkhat cheh chu tongli alhing cheh in, khom todal khat cheh ding chun kisilna kongkhat akikoije. \x + \xo 7:38 \xt Potdohbu 30:17-21\x*  
\v 39 Chuin khom todal chengse chu atungdoh sohkeijin, Hou-In lhanglama chun khomtodal nga aphut in Hou-In sahlam a jong khom todal nga ma aphutdoh e, chule lhanglam nisolam Hou-In ninga chun twikong chu ado'n ahi.  
\v 40 Hiram chun bel ho jong leilona ho jong twibel ho jong asem sohkeije,  
\p Hiram in Solomon lengpa panpina Pakai Hou-In sahna ding chungchanga atohpeh ding jouse chu abonchan atongsoh tan ahi.   
\b  
\li1
\v 41 Khompi teni ahin;  
\li1 khompi teni tomna dinga alujum kisem teni ahin;  
\li1 alujum teni tomna dinga sum-eng chaokol jella kijel teni ahin, lenchapeh a kipheh khompi teni lutomna kimang teni jong ahin,   
\li1
\v 42 lencha pheh banga kipheh teni dinga kisem kolbuthei pah tobang 400 jen ahin, khompi teni lutomna ding’a kibol lencha pheh banga kipheh khat cheh a pang dia golni’a ding kolbuthei pah kisem chengse chutoh ahin;   
\li1
\v 43 khomtodal chengse ahin khomtodal chunga pang ding twibel som jong ahin;   
\li1
\v 44 Chujongleh twikong khat ahin, hiche twikong kisem noija chun bongchal som le ni lim akisem in;   
\li1
\v 45 bel ahin leilona ho ahin, kisilna kongho ahin Pakai insunga kimang kongle bel jouse hi  
\b  
\m Hiram in Solomon lengpa lamhilna dungjuiya ana sema, sum-eng jeng’a ana lhah ahi.  
\v 46 Jordan vadung pang phaicham lah a Succoth le Zerethan kikah a bel lei kimuna dinga chu Lengpa’n ana lheh ahiye.  
\v 47 Kong le bel atam behseh phat in Solomon in tetoh louvin aban umsah gam tan ahi; hijeh chun sum-eng chengse chu ijat monga gih hi ding ham ti hetdoh louvin aum doh lotai.   
\p
\v 48 Solomon in Pakai Hou-In sunga manchah ding thil le lo asem chengse chu hicheng hi ahi:  
\b  
\li1 sana maicham ahin;  
\li1 kilhaina ding changlhah todohna ding dokhang ahin, \x + \xo 7:48 \xt Potdohbu 30:1-3; \xt Potdohbu 25:23-30\x*   
\li1
\v 49 sana thengsel a kisem thaomei khom ahin, insung dan mun theng maija akitung in lhanglam ngan abah nga akitung in, sahlam ngan bah nga ma akitung’e,  
\li1 pahcha lim kisem le thaomei ho ahin, cheiche chengse chutoh ahin, sana jong ahiuve;  
\li1 \x + \xo 7:49 \xt Potdohbu 25:31-40\x*  
\v 50 akhom chengse le thaomei jeng chengse toh, kisilna kong ho leh gimnamtui halna cheng ahin, khangbel jong ahin, aboncha chu sana jeng’a kisema ahin;  
\li1 chujongleh Mun Theng Chungnung pen kitilai Hou-In dan sungnung penna kotpi dunga akot bil ding jong sana jeng ahin Hou-In lailunga kotpi kil jouse jong sana ma-ma ahi cheh e.   
\b  
\p
\v 51 Hitobang hin Pakai Hou-In sahna chung changa Solomon lengpan abol ding jouse chu aboldoh tan akichai sohtai. Chujongleh Solomon chun apa David in ana katdohsa thil jouse ahin polut pai-paijin dangka jong, kong le bel jouse jong abonchan Pakai Hou-In sunga thil kholna insunga akhol khom sahtan ahi. \x + \xo 7:51 \xt 2 Samuel 8:11; 1 Thusimbu 18:11\x*   
\c 8  
\s1 Hou-In Sunga Thingkhong Kipohlut  
\p
\v 1 Solomon Lengpan Israel te phung bahkai ho leh phung jouse lamkai ho leh upaho jouse Jerusalem'a hunga David khopi Zion a konna Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong chu hinpua Hou-In'a thahlut dingin akou khom tan ahi. \x + \xo 8:1 \xt 2 Samuel 6:12-16; 1 Thusimbu 15:25-29\x*  
\v 2 Hiti chun Israel te chu lha sagi channa Ethanim lhasung in hoibitna golvah umkhom dingin ahung kikhom tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 8:2 \xt Thempu Dan 23:34\x*   
\p
\v 3 Israel lamkaiho jouse ahung kikhop khom phat un thempu hon apu uvin akipat doh tauve.  
\v 4 Levi te le thempu hon Pakai umpina ponbuh chuleh manchah thengho jouse chutoh Hou-In'ah apolut un ahi.  
\v 5 Solomon Lengpa leh Israel mipi ho jouse chu Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong masanga chun akikhom un kelngoi tamtah leh bongchal tamtah athat un kilhaina pumgo thilto abol'un agancha tha hou chu atam behseh jeh in simjou ahipon ahi!   
\p
\v 6 Hichun thempu hon Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong chu Hou-In sunga apolut un cherub teni lhaving noi Muntheng Chungnung pen achun akoi tauvin ahi.  
\v 7 Hiti chun thingkong chuleh aputna moljol teni jong chu cherub teni lhalim noija chun aum tan ahi.  
\v 8 Hiche aputna mol teni hi Mun Theng Pen masang’a chu kikoi ahin Mun Theng apat a chu idin leh jangpet in akimu theijin, mun choma konin vang akimu thei pon ahi. Hiche moljol teni hi tuni geijin aum nalaije.  
\v 9 Hiche Kitepna Thingkhong sung’a hin thil dang aum pon Israel te Egypt a konna ahung potdoh uva Pathen'in Sinai Mol’a Mose ana peh Israel te toh akitepna songpheng teni bou chu aum'in ahi. \x + \xo 8:9 \xt Danbu Ni Na 10:5\x*   
\p
\v 10 Thempuho chu Mun Theng Pen a konna ahung potdoh tengu leh meilom sa-tah chun Hou-In chu akhu khum jeng jin ahi \x + \xo 8:10 \xt Potdohbu 40:34,35\x*  
\v 11 Meilom chun Hou-In ahin khu tengleh Pathen loupina chun Hou-In alodimji in Thempu hon na atong jom theiji tapouvin ahi.   
\s1 Solomon In Pathen Athangvah  
\p
\v 12 Hiteng chuleh Solomon in taona amang jin, “O Pakai, meilom a khun kaumji na-na ti, \x + \xo 8:12 \xt Labu 18:11; 97:2\x*  
\v 13 Pakai tuhin tonsotna na chenna thei dingin hiche Hou-In thupitah hi ka sahdoh peh tan ahi!” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Hijou teng chuleh lengpa chu ahung kiheijin avel’a ding mihonpi hiti hin phatthei aboh in ahi.  
\v 15 “Pakai, Israel te Pathen chu thangvah in umhen! Aman kapa David kom’a ana kitepna chu amolso tan ahi, ajeh chu Aman kapa kom'ah,  
\v 16 ‘Kami Israel te chu Egypt a konna kahin puidoh apat chun, keima ei kihouna ding Hou-In akisahna dingin Israel te chenna gam khopi khatcha jong kana lhengpon ahinlah David nangma hi kami Israel te chunga vaihom dingin kana lhengin ahi!’” anati. \x + \xo 8:16 \xt 2 Samuel 7:4-11; 1 Thusimbu 17:3-10\x*   
\p
\v 17 Chuin Solomon chun aseiben, “Kapa, David, chun Pakai Israel te Pathen min loupi dopsangna dingin Hou-In ana sagon ahi. \x + \xo 8:17 \xt 2 Samuel 7:1-3; 1 Thusimbu 17:1,2\x*  
\v 18 Pakaijin Keima min loupina ding’a Hou-In sah nagot nalungtup chu ahoinai,  
\v 19 hinlah hiche Hou-In sa ding chu nang nahipoi, keima min loupina Hou-In sa ding chu na chate lah a khatpen in asah ding ahi bouve!” ati. \x + \xo 8:19 \xt 2 Samuel 7:12,13; 1 Thusimbu 17:11,12\x*   
\p
\v 20 “Tun Pakai nangin na kitepna chu na lolhin sah tan kapa khel'in keima leng kahung chang tan chuleh Pakai nangma nakitepna bangin Israel laltouna a chun keima katou tan ahi. Tun Israel Pakai nangma min loupina dingin Hou-In chu kahin tungdoh tan ahi.  
\v 21 Chuleh Pakai nangin kapu kapa te’u Egypt a konna nahin puidoh hotoh na-na Kitepna Thingkhong jong chu akoina ding kahin gong tan ahi,” ati.   
\s1 Solomon Hou-In Alhandoh Taona  
\p
\v 22 Hijou chun, Solomon chu Israel mipite jouse masang Pakai maicham noija chun adingin, vanlam’ah akhut adom sang'in,  
\v 23 hitin atao tai,  
\b  
\pmo “Vo Pakai Israel Pathen, hiche vannoi leiset ahin nang tobang Pathen dang aumpoi. Nangma mitmua alungthim pumpia kalsongho chungah na kitepna dungjuijin na ngailutna lhasam louhel'in na musah jingin ahi.  
\v 24 Nangin kapa David kom'a nakitepna chu na lhakang pon ahi. Nangman nakam’a na phondoh nakitepna bangin na khut tah in tunin na lolhin sah tan ahi,” ati.   
\pm
\v 25 “Chule tun, O Pakai, Israel Pathen, nangin kapa David kom'a na-na kitepna aban jong chu subulhit tan. Ajeh chu nangman ama kom’a na-na sei chun, 'Na chilhah ten lamdih ahin chepi uva, nang chouna banga kitahna neitah a ajui uva ahileh na chate lah a khat pen-pen chu Israel laltouna a hung toupeh ding ahi bouve nati chu.' \x + \xo 8:25 \xt 1 Lgt 2:4\x*  
\v 26 Tun, O Israel Pathen, nasohpa kapa David kom’a hitia na-na kitepna chu tuhin subulhit tan.   
\pm
\v 27 Ahinlah Pathen chu hiche leiset a hi iti chen ding ham? Ijeh inem itileh, van sangpen in jong nadol ponte chuti ahileh hiche keiman ka tundoh Hou-In hin iti nadol ding ham? \x + \xo 8:27 \xt 2 Thusimbu 2:6\x*  
\v 28 Hijeng jongleh, O Pakai ka Pathen, ka taona le kathumna hi nei ngaipeh in, nasohpa na kom’a ka kana le ka taona hi nei ngaipeh teijin.  
\v 29 Nangin 'Kamin um jing ding ahi,' na-na tina hiche Hou-In hi asun ajanin hin velhi jingin lang, hiche lang ngatna katao chan’in nangin kataona nei ngaipeh in. \x + \xo 8:29 \xt Danbu Ni Na 12:11\x*  
\v 30 Nami Israel te lah ahin keima kahin hiche lang ngatna kisunemtah le ngaichatna nei tah a kahung tao tengu leh neihin ngaipeh teijun, van na chenna mun a konna nahin jah teng jongleh nei ngaipeh un, najah tengleh nei ngaidam’un.  
\v 31 Khat touvin mikhat chunga bolkhel aneiya, hiche Hou-In maicham maiya hi kamopoi tia kihahsel a auma ahileh,  
\v 32 chuteng nangin vanna kon'in hin ngaijin lang mihehpa le akihehpa kikah a thu hintan’in lang athemmo chu achan dingdol chansah jengin, chuleh themmona nei loupa chu them chansah jengin.   
\pm
\v 33 Nami Israel ten nangma douna a achonset jeh uva agalmi hon ahinjo uva chuteng ama hon athemmonau ahin kihet uva na kom ahinbel uva hiche Hou-In a hi ahung tao uva ahileh,  
\v 34 hiteng chule vanna kon'in ataonau hin ngaijin lang nami Israel te hi achonset nau hin ngaidam inlang, apu apateu na-na pehna hiche gam'ah hinlepui kit teijin.   
\pm
\v 35 Namite hi nangma douna a achonset jeh uva go na juhsahlou tengleh amaho achonset nau ahung kisih uva namin ahin pat uva hiche Hou-In lang ngatna ahung tao teng uleh,  
\v 36 nangman van a kon'in ataonau hin ngaijin lang nami Israel te hi achonset nau hin ngaidam in. Ama ho hin lampi dih achepi theina diuvin hin hil’in chuleh amaho ding tumbeh a napeh gam leiset chunga hin go hin juhsah kit jitan.   
\pm
\v 37 Ijem tia gamsung’a hi kellhah ham ahilouleh natna hivei lang’a ham ahilou jongleh anche louhing ho khaokho te ham, lungkang te ham ahung lan jeng ham ahilouleh akhopi hou hi min ahin delkhum jeng ham ahi louva natset ham in ahin lonvuh jengu ham,  
\v 38 nami Israel te hin hiche Hou-In lang hi ahin ngatna aban ahin jah uva ahung tao uva ahahsat nau hi ahin lhut teng uleh,  
\v 39 hiteng chule na chenna van gam a kon'in hin ngaidam in. Na mite hin achonnau dungjuiya achan diuva lom chu pejengin, ajeh chu nangin mi lungthim jouse jong nahet sohkei sa ahi.  
\v 40 Hitia chu nabol teng apu apateu na-na pehna hiche gam ahi achen laise uvin nangma na ging jing tauvinte.   
\pm
\v 41 Khonung tengleh nami Israel te hilou gamchom miho jong hin, nangma hina hin hedoh untin, namin jal’a gamla tah a kon a hi hung diu ahi.  
\v 42 Ajeh chu amaho hin namin loupi kithan hi ahin hetdoh diu, naban thahatna ahin bol diu chutengleh amahon jong Hou-In lang hi ahin ngat uva hung tao diu,  
\v 43 hiteng chule na chenna van a kon'in hin ngaipeh inlang chule ataonau chu hin sanpeh in. Hitia chu nami Israel ten nahet bang uva hi leiset chung’a mipi ho jouse hin nahina ahin het diu nahin gin diu ahi. Amaho jong hin namin loupina dinga hiche Hou-In kahin tundoh hi ahin het diu ahi.   
\pm
\v 44 Namite hi agalteu toh kisat dinga akon uva hahsatna ato jeh uva keiman namin loupina dinga kahin tundoh hiche Hou-In ahin ngat uva ahung tao tengu leh,  
\v 45 chuteng van mun a kon'in ataonau hin ngaijin lang angaichat u hin suh bulhit peh in.   
\pm
\v 46 Amaho nangma douna a ahung chonset jeng uva ahileh koi hi achonse khalou um am? Nangma jeng jong nalunghanga agal miteu na josah thei ahilouleh agal miteuvin agam uva gal hing’a na kaimang sah thei jong ahi.  
\v 47 Ahinlah hiche a asoh channau migam’a chu alung’u ahin hei uva nangma kom ahinbel uva, 'Keiho ka chonse uvin thilse tah tah bol kahi tauve,' atiuva ahung tao uleh,  
\v 48 hitia chu alungthim pumpi uva nangma kom ahinbel uva, hiche asohchan nau gamchom mun a konna chu nangin apu apateu na-na pehna gam lang ahin ngat’u ahilouleh nangin napeh khopi lang ahin ngat u ahilouleh namin loupina dinga kahin tundoh hiche Hou-In lang hi ahin ngat uva ahung tao uleh,  
\v 49 hiteng chuleh na chenna van a kon'in atao nau chu hin ngai inlang ahahsat nau hin vetpeh teijin.  
\v 50 Chujongleh na mite hi nangma douna a achonset tengu leh nangma doumah abolnau achonset nau hin ngaidam teijin. Gal hing’a mangho agal miteu khotona hin musah teijin,  
\v 51 ajeh chu amaho namite Egypt meibang’a sa thohgimna a konna nahin puidoh na deilhen nam mite ahiuve.   
\pm
\v 52 Keima thil thum leh nami Israel te thil thum neihin vetpeh unlang amaho hin itih phat hijongleh na kom’a akanau ngaipeh tei-teijin.  
\v 53 Ajeh chu, O Chungnungpen Pakai, nangin nasoh Mose kom’a chun Israel te hi leiset chunga namdang ho lah a kon’a nanga dinga nami deilhen ahiuve na-na tin ahi,” ati.   
\s1 Hou-In Kithenso Na  
\m
\v 54 Solomon in hiche Pakai kom’a atao sunga chu akhut teni van chung langa adop sang’a ana dilsua ahin; taona ho leh athil thum ho hi achai phat in Pakai maicham maija konin ading doh tan ahi.  
\v 55 Israel mipi ho jouse chu ogingtah in phatthei aboh in:   
\p
\v 56 “Pathen chu thangvah in umhen, ajeh chu ami Israel tehi aman ana kitepna jouse hi eina teppeh bang bangun, kicholdona phat chu eimu sah tauve. Aman alhachapa Mose a kon’a ana phondohsa ana kitepna thil loupitah ho chu khatcha athon um louvin ahin tongdoh sohkei tan ahi. \x + \xo 8:56 \xt Danbu Ni Na 12:10; Joshua 21:44,45\x*  
\v 57 Pakai I-Pathen uvin ipu ipate’u ana umpi bangin eiho jong eiumpi jing tauhen, aman ei dalhah da uhenlang pai jong eipaidoh hihbeh uhen.  
\v 58 Imalam jousea ama deilam hinkho eimansah uhen lang, chuleh ama thupeh leh Dan semho einitsah uhenlang chuleh alung lhaina lampia ipu ipateu ana pui bangin eiho jong eipui uhen.  
\v 59 Chuleh Pakai anga tunia ka taona thucheng ho hi asun ajanin a angsung’a ging jing hen, hitia chu ami Israel te hi nitin ingaichat dungjui uva thudih a eipui theina diuvin.  
\v 60 Vannoi leiset a cheng mihem jousen Pakai bou hi Pathen ahin adang aumpoi ti ahin het diu ahitai.  
\v 61 Hiteng chuleh nang hon jong Pakai I-Pathen kitahna lhingsetna najui diu, chuleh a chondan ho leh a thupeh ho jouse hi tuni chan geija nahin jui ahileh najui lhungkei thei diu ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 62 Hijou chun lengpa leh Israel mipi ten kilhaina gantha abol tauvin ahi.  
\v 63 Solomon in chamna thilto in abongchal 22,000 atoh in kelngoite le kelcha 12,000 atoh in ahi. Hiti hin lengpa le Israel mipi ten Pakai Hou-In achun todohna anei un ahi.   
\p
\v 64 Hiche nikho ma-ma hin lengpan Pakai Hou-In maiya hongcha chu athenso in ahi. Aman hikom'a chun pumgo thilto atoh in, lhosoh thilto jong atoh doh in chamna thil to sathao jong atoh in asuhtheng ahi, ajeh chu Pakai angsung’a kido sum-eng maicham chu pumgo thiltona, lhosoh thiltona, chamna thilto, sathaoho todohna dinga kitung chu aneo behseh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 65 Hijou chun Solomon leh Israel pumpin Pakai I-Pathen'u angsunga hoibitna golvah kut abol'un ahi. Sahlanga Lebo-hamath apat lhanglam Egypt twinah putna chan geijin mipi tamtah akikhom doh un ahi. Hiche golvah hi agomin nisom le nili alut in nisagi hi maicham todohna ahin, nisagi hi hoibitna golvah kut ahi.  
\v 66 Hiche golvah hi akichai soh phat in, Solomon in miho chu a incheh a asol tan ahi. Ama hon lengpa chu phatthei aboh un kipah tah le thanom tah in ain uva akinung le tauvin ahi. Ajeh chu Pakai hi alhacha David ding leh Israel mipite dingin apha lheh jengin ahi.   
\c 9  
\s1 Pakaijin Solomon Taona Adonbut  
\p
\v 1 Tun Solomon in Pakai Hou-In leh ama leng inpi asa chai tan ahi. Aman toh dinga agontoh dungjuijin ijakai atongchai sohhel tan ahi.  
\v 2 Hichun Pakai chu tu masang’a Gibeon a ana kilah bang bangin, tun anivei channa in Solomon kom'ah ahung kilah kit tan ahi. \x + \xo 9:2 \xt 1 Lgt 3:5; 2 Thusimbu 1:7\x*  
\v 3 Pakaijin aheng'ah aseijin,  
\b  
\pmo “Keiman na taona le na ngaichat nahin lhut ho chu kahe tai. Keiman hiche Hou-In hi ka thenso tai. Hiche hi a itih channa keima min kija jing na dinga na sahdoh ahitai. Hiche hi ka lungthim gil’a ka ngainat khat ahijeh in keiman hiche hi vesui jing nang’e.   
\pm
\v 4 Chuleh nangin napa David banga kitah tah leh lungtheng tah a nei juiya, kathupeh leh ka Dan ho nanit jing’a ka chondan najui jing’a ahileh,  
\v 5 hiteng chuleh Israel lenggam hi atonsotna katundoh jing ding ahi. Ajeh chu napa David kom’a kana kitepna banga: 'Israel laltouna’a hi nachilhah khat katousah jing ding ahi.' \x + \xo 9:5 \xt 1 Lgt 2:4\x*   
\pm
\v 6 “Ahinla nangma ahilouleh na chilhah ten nangma ka seipeh, ka Dan sem ho leh kathupeh ho hi na paidoh a, na juida a pathen dang nahou uva na jon uleh,  
\v 7 chuteng keiman hiche gam kapeh nauva Israel hi kakaidoh ding kamin loupina ding’a hiche Hou-In ka thensosa jong hi kapaidoh ding chule Israel jong hi namdang te nuisat leh tot thanghoiya naum ding’u ahi.  
\v 8 Chujongleh tuhin hiche Hou-In hi thupi lheh jeng jongleh hiteng chule ahin hopa jousen alu u apei uva adatmo diu ahi. Amaho kidongto uvin tin, “Iti dan a Pakaijin hiche gam le hiche Hou-In hi manlou aso hitam?” ati diu ahi. \x + \xo 9:8 \xt 2 Lengte 25:9; 2 Thusimbu 36:19\x*   
\pm
\v 9 Chule amaho chu hitia hi kidonbutto diu ahi, “Ajeh chu hiche mite hin Egypt a kon’a apu apa teu hin puidoh a, Pakai a Pathen’u chu adonda uva pathen dang ahou uva, achibai jeh u ahi, hijeh a chu Pakaijin achung uva hitobang hamsetna hi alhunsah ahitai,” ati diu ahi.   
\s1 Solomon Le Hiram In Kinoptona Asem  
\p
\v 10 Solomon in Pakai Hou-In asahna le ama leng inpi sahna a kum somni asuhlut nung phat kichai lam in,  
\v 11 aman Tyre Lengpa Hiram chu Galilee gam’a khopi somni chu ana pen ahi. (Hiram hin, Solomon in ana thum dungjuiya, Cedar le Cypress thing chuleh sana ana peh ahi.)  
\v 12 Ahin Tyre a kon'in Hiram hi ahungin Solomon in apeh khopi ho chu ahung ven ahileh akipah behseh pon ahi.  
\v 13 Hijeh chun Hiram in Solomon jah a, “Sopi, hiche khopiho pikhu ipi ding ham?” atin ahi. Hijeh chun Hiram in hiche gam chu Cabul (hichu “panna bei”) tin amin asah e. Tunigei hin hiti chun amin akivo den in ahi.  
\v 14 Ahiyeng vang'in, Hiram in Solomon chu sana talent jakhat le somni ana pen ahi.   
\s1 Solomon Tohdoh Adang Ho  
\p
\v 15 Solomon lengpan soh natong mi ana goiya ana sahdoh ho chu; Pakai Hou-In, Leng inpi le avel ho, Jerusalem pal kikaikhum, Hazor, Megiddo leh Gezer khopi ho chu ahi.  
\v 16 Egypt lengpa Pharaoh in Gezer chu gal anokhum’a analah a, Canaan mite ana thagam’a meiya ahal lhah jou uva hiche khopi chu Solomon toh kicheng achanu akanpeh ahi.  
\v 17 Solomon in hiche Gezer khopi chu asapha kit in, aman Beth-horon noi lang khopi ho jong chu asapha kit in ahi.  
\v 18 Hiche gamsung’a gammang lah a um Baalath le Tamar jong chu ahi.  
\v 19 Aman thil kholna ding leh sakol ho leh sakol kangtalai ho koina dingin jong khopi ho ana sadoh in ahi. Aman Jerusalem le Lebanon a chuleh agamsung pumpi’a asah doh nom jouse ana sahdoh sohkei ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Agamsung’a chun Israel mi hilou phabep jong ana chengun ahi. Ama ho chu Amon mite, Hit mite, Periz mite, Hiv mite leh Jebus mite ahiuve.  
\v 21 Ama ho hi Israel miten ana thamoh nam mite son le chilhah ho ahiuve. Hijeh chun Solomon in amaho chu soh natong in ana pansah in hiti hin ama hon tuni geijin soh natong in ana pang jingun ahi.  
\v 22 Solomon in Israel te vang namna a natong lah a ana pansah pon ahi. Hiti hin Israel mite chu galsat sepai leh gal lamkai jat chom-chom in ana pansah in sakol kangtalai tol'in jong ana pansah in ahi.  
\v 23 Solomon in gamsung’a kivaihomna a natoh jat chom-choma alamkai ding leh avesui dingin mi 550 ana pansah in ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Solomon in Pharaoh chanu akichenpi ajinu chu David khopi’a kon'in Leng inpi thah ama ding’a ana sahpeh na mun achun achonlut in ahi. Hiche achun Solomon'in hiche inpi to kimat in dang jong asan ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Solomon in Pakaiya maicham semna dinga ana sah mun ahin pumgo thilto le chamna thilto kumkhat sungin thumvei ana boljin ahi. Aman Pakaiya gimnamtui jong ana halnam jin ahi. Hiti hin Hou-In sahdohna a natohna jouse chu ana chai sohkei jin ahi. \x + \xo 9:25 \xt Potdohbu 23:17; 34:23; Danbu Ni Na 16:16\x*   
\p
\v 26 Solomon Lengpan Twikhanglen pang, Edom gam'ah Elath kongkai mun kom'ah kong-innei hon khat ana sem’e.  
\v 27 Hiram in kongtol themho Solomon mite toh kongtol khom dingin ahin solpeh in ahi.  
\v 28 Ama hon Ophir mun a atol'un chule Solomon dingin sana ton som le gup ahin pohpeh un ahi.   
\c 10  
\s1 Sheba Lengnun Solomon Ahungvil  
\p
\v 1 Sheba lengnu in Solomon minthanna hi ichan geija, Pakai min loupina adopsang ho thu ajah phat in thudoh hah tah-tah ho doh a patep dingin ahung kon tan ahi. \x + \xo 10:1 \xt Matt 12:42; Lk 11:31\x*  
\v 2 Ama chu anungjui tamtah toh, gimnamtui tamtah tah, sana le songmantam tamtah ahinpo uvin sangongsao honkhat ah ahung touvun Jerusalem ahunglhung tauvin ahi. Amanu'n Solomon toh akimuto phat in akihoulimpi in thudoh ahung kigotna jouse tamtah chu adong tan ahi.  
\v 3 Solomon in athudoh jouse chu bailam tah in adonbut sohkeijin, khatcha jong lengpa ding chun ahahsa aumpon ahi.  
\v 4 Sheba lengnu chun Solomon chu ichan geija ching ham tichu amu chet jeh chuleh aleng inpi kisah dan chu amudoh phat in,  
\v 5 alungthim’ah datmona in adim lheh jing tan ahi. Amanu’n aneh achah u dokhang chung’a umho chu amun, avaihomna noija kinpi natohna von ho, acha donnau khon domho chuleh Solomon'in Pakai Hou-In a namtui alhut nam ho chu amun ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Amanu in asaptho jengin lengpa jah ah, “Na chihna le na tohdoh ho kagam sung’a kaum’a kajah ho jouse chu adih sohkeije!” ati.  
\v 7 Ka thujah ho chu keima tah kahunga kamit tah a kahung muchet tokahsen kana tahsan pon ahi. Ahin tahbeh in seileng ken kanajah ho chu akehkhat jeng jong alhing joupoi. Na chihna ho leh na haona ho hi kanajah ho chu gam chengin akho khal in ahi.  
\v 8 Na mipite hin ichan geijin nom asa tadiuvem! Na vaihomna noiya natong na masang’a ding jing’a na chihna thungai jing ho hi ichan geija hamphatna chang hitauvem!  
\v 9 Pakai na Pathen chu thangvah in umhen, aman lung lhaisel’a Israel laltouna hi na losah ahitai. Na Pakaijin Israel te tang thei louva angailut jeh a kitahna le dihna a vaipo dinga nang hi aleng uva na tundoh ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 10 Hijou chun amanu’n lengpa chu sana pounds 900, gimnamtui leh songmantam tamtah jong apen ahi. Sheba lengnun Solomon lengpa gimnamtui apeh tobang hi koiman ape khapon ahi.   
\p
\v 11 (Hiche ban a jong hin Hiram kongtol hon Ophir a kon'in sana toh thingnamtui akihetna dimset toh chuleh songmantam hotoh ahinpo uvin ahi.  
\v 12 Solomon lengpan hiche thingnamtui ho chu Pakai Hou-In douna le lengpa in douna in amangin, lathem ho dingin semjang saithei leh selangdah din jong asempeh in ahi. Tumasang’a ahin tunung’a ahin hitobang thing namtui ahung kipolut aum kha tapon ahi.)   
\p
\v 13 Solomon lengpa chun Sheba lengnu chu athum jouse ape jengin chuleh angaichat chan chu hongphal tah in anape jengin ahi. Hijou chun Sheba lengnu chu asohte cheng chutoh agam lang’ah ana kile kittan ahi.   
\s1 Solomon Nei Le Gou Ho  
\p
\v 14 Kumseh a Solomon lengpa henga sana hunglut hi tons 25 alhingin ahi.  
\v 15 Hiche hi akivei gunset ho leh kahlah a thil joh leho a konna kai kila ho chuleh Arab lang’a gamvaipo ho a konna kimu ho pang nailou ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Solomon lengpan sana a kikhong Ompho lentah tah 200 asemin khat cheh hi pound som le nga in agih in ahi.  
\v 17 Aman sana a kikhong Ompho aneoloi 300 jong asemin khat cheh chu pound li lhing deh agih in ahi. Lengpan hiche Ompho ho hi Lebanon Gammang kiti a Leng Inpi a chun akoijin ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Solomon lengpan laltouna lentah khat jong saiha in asemin ahi. Hiche laltouna a kisem chu sana mangchan hoitah in atomjolsel in ahi.  
\v 19 Laltouna chu akaltouna ding kalbi gup kido touva ahin, laltouna achungnung lam chu akikol'in ahi. Hiche laltouna ajet aveija chun khut ngapna aum cheh in chule alangto a chun Keipi bahkai ading limkhat khat toh asemin ahi.  
\v 20 Hiche kalbi gup chu khat cheh pang achun Keipi bahkai khat cheh adingin ahileh abon'in Keipi bahkai lim som le ni alhing in ahi. Vannoi leiset a laltouna dang ho hiche toh tekahpi thei ding aumpon ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Solomon lengpa twidonna khon jouse chu sana thenga kisem ngen ahin, chuleh Lebanon Gammang kiti Leng Inpi sung’a manchah jouse jong chu sana a kisem ngen ahin, dangka a kisem khatcha jong aum pon ahi, ajeh chu Solomon khanglai achun dangka chun aman aneipon ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Lengpan kiveina a manchah ding kong innei khat jong aneijin, hiche ho chu Hiram kong innei hotoh aki tolkhom jin ahi. Hiche kong innei ho hi kum thumseh leh inlang'ah ahung kile jiuvin, sana, dangka, saiha, guldu leh vahong kong dimset set in ahinpo jiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Hiti hin Solomon lengpa hi leiset chunga leng dang ho sang'in ahao jon chule aching jong aching jon ahi.  
\v 24 Hijeh chun Pathen'in apeh, chihna thungai ding leh thudoh nei dingin muntin a kon'in mipi ahung hung jingun ahi.  
\v 25 Kumseh in ama vil’a hung jousen kipa thilpeh in sana, dangka, ponsil, gal manchah, gimnamtui, sakol ho leh sakolpol ho ahin poh peh jingun ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Solomon sakol ho leh sakol kangtalai ho jong thaneitah in ana tungdoh in ahi. Aman sakol 12,000 aneijin, sakol kangtalai 1,400 aneijin ahi. Aman phabep chu sakol kangtalai koina khopi ho a akoiyin phabep chu Jerusalem sung ama kom naina ah akoijin ahi. \x + \xo 10:26 \xt 1 Lgt 4:26\x*  
\v 27 Lengpan dangka aneiho vang chu songtoh ana bahsah jengin ahi. Chuleh Cedar thing mantam tah ho jong chu Judah gam'a keh theipi thing toh abahsah jengin ahi. \x + \xo 10:27 \xt Danbu Ni Na 17:17\x*  
\v 28 Solomon in sakol ho hi Egypt leh Cilicia a konna achohji ahin, lengpa ding’a thilcho ho hin Cilicia mun a hi kimantah a achoh jiu ahi. \x + \xo 10:28 \xt Danbu Ni Na 17:16\x*  
\v 29 Hiche phat lai chun Egypt a kon'in sakol kangtalai khat chu dangka 600 a kicho ahin sakol khat chu dangka150 a kichoji ahi. Hijouteng chuleh Hit leh Aram lengho kom'a ajoh son kitjiu ahi.   
\c 11  
\s1 Solomon'in Ji Tamtah Anei  
\p
\v 1 Tun Solomon lengpa hin gamchom mi numei tamtah ana ngailu tan ahi. Pharaoh chanu ana kichenpi kalval in jong Moab numei, Ammon numei, Edom numei, Sidon numei leh Hit numei ho jong akichenpi in ahi. \x + \xo 11:1 \xt Danbu Ni Na 17:17\x*  
\v 2 Pakaijin Israel mipite chu kicheh tah a, “Hiche namdang mite chu nakichenpi lou diu ahi, ajeh chu ama hon a pathen ho hou dia na lungthim’u aheilut diu ahi,” tia ana hilchah ahi. Ahinlah Solomon in amaho chu ana ngailu thou-thou in ahi. \x + \xo 11:2 \xt Potdohbu 34:16; Danbu Ni Na 7:3,4\x*  
\v 3 Aman leng chanu te jeng 700 ana kichenpi in chuleh thaikem 300 ana neije. Atahbeh in amaho hin alung hi Pakaiya kon'in ana puimang tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Solomon chu ahung teh phat in, alungthim hi semthu pathen dang hounan ana heilut tauvin, apa David bangin a Pakai a Pathen ah kitah tah in pan ana lajou tapon ahi.  
\v 5 Solomon in Sidon mite semthu numei-pathen Ashtoreth leh thet umtah Ammon mite semthu pathen Molech chu ana hou tan ahi.  
\v 6 Hiti hin Solomon in Pakai mitmu’n thilse tah chu anabol tan ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Jerusalem solam, Olive molchung ah, aman thet umtah Moab te semthu pathen Chemosh leh thet umtah Ammon mite semthu pathen Molech houna dingin doiphung ana tungdoh tan ahi.  
\v 8 Solomon in gamchom numei akichenpi aji ten asemthu pathen ho kom'a kilhaina pumgo thilto abolna diu leh gimnamtui ahalnamna diuvin doiphung ana tundoh peh in ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Pakai chu Solomon chunga ana lunghang lheh jeng tan ahi, ajeh chu Pakai Israel Pathen ahenga nivei tah ahung kilah nunga, aman alungthim Pakaiya konna aheimang jeh ahi.  
\v 10 Aman Solomon hi pathen dang ahou louna dia kicheh tah a ana gihsalsa ahin, ahinla Solomon in Pakai thupeh chu ana nahsah tapon ahi.  
\v 11 Hijeh chun tun Pakaijin akom'ah hiti hin thu asei tan ahi, “Nangin henasasa a ikitepna na suhkeh jeh leh ka Danthu nanit lou jeh in, keiman lenggam hi nang’a konna ka lahdoh a nasohte lah a khat kapeh ding ahitai.  
\v 12 Ahinlah napa David jal’a nahinlai sunga hichu kabol louding, nachapa leng vaipoh akon a bou ka lahdoh ding ahi.  
\v 13 Ahinlah keiman lenggam pumpi chu ka lahdoh louding, ka lhachapa David jal le ka lhentum khopi Jerusalem jal’a phungkhat vang ka dalhah peh ding ahi,” ati.   
\s1 Solomon Douho  
\p
\v 14 Hijeh chun Pakaijin Edom mite leng insung a kon'in, Hadad kitipa chu Solomon kidoupi dingin ana tungdoh tan ahi.  
\v 15 Kum phabep masanga chu David in Edom mite hi gal anajo ahi. Asepai lamkai Joab chu Israel sepai galmun’a thiho chu avui ding’a anaum den’ah ahi. Hichea aum sung chun Edom pasal ho chu ana that gam’in ahi.  
\v 16 Joab leh Israel sepai te chu lha gup sung ana umden u ahin, hiche sung’a chu Edom mite chu ana tha gam’u ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Ahin hiche thilso lai chun, Hadad leh apa insunga natong pipuiho chu Egypt lang’a ana jammang’u ahi. (Hiche phat laiya chun Hadad chu chapang cha ahi nalaiye.)  
\v 18 Amaho chun Midian adalha uvin Paran ajon’un, Paran ahin mi phabep in ahinbe uvin ahi. Hichun Egypt geiyin akitol’un lengpa henga acheu le aman Hadad gam leh in apen, neh le chah jong anape un ahi.  
\v 19 Pharaoh in Hadad chu angailu lheh jengin, aman ajinu Lengnu Tahpenes sopinu chu aji dingin ana pen ahi.  
\v 20 Amanu’n chapa khat ahinpeh in amin Genubath asah tan ahi. Tahpenes lengnun Pharaoh leng inpi’ah, lengpa chate toh anavah khanglen in chule ana khoukhah in ahi.   
\p
\v 21 David leh asepai lamkaipa Joab chu athitai kiti thu chu Egypt alhun phat in aman Pharaoh heng’ah, “Keima ka gam lang’a kile tang’e neisol tan,” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Pharaoh in, “Ipi dingin em? Hiche a hi ipi lhinglel nasah a na inlang’a nakile nom ham?” ati.  
\p “Ima avat aumpoi, hijongleh lungset tah in ka inlam’a nei kile sah tan,” ati.   
\p
\v 23 Pathen'in Eliada chapa Rezon jong chu Solomon dou dingin ahin tildoh in ahi. Rezon chu apupa Zobah lengpa Hadadezer a konna hung jamdoh ahi.  
\v 24 Hijeh a chu galbol loikhat lah a lamkaija hung pang’a ahi. David in Hadadezer chu gal’a akisatpia ajo phat chun Rezon le amite chu Damascus lama ajam’un hiche achun leng in ahung pang tan ahi.  
\v 25 Rezon hi Solomon vaihom achaina geijin Israel ten akidoupi akhoh penin ahung pang peh in, Hadad bangin boina ana sem jengin ahi. Rezon hin Israel te hi ahot lheh jengin, hiti chun Aram gamsunga leng in ana pang den tan ahi.   
\s1 Jeroboam In Solomon Ahin Dou  
\p
\v 26 Solomon noiya natong pipui khat Nebat chapa Jeroboam jong hi adouho lah a lamkai khat ahi. Ama hi Ephraim gam Zeredah khopi’a kon ahin anu hi Zeruah kiti meithai nu chu ahi.   
\p
\v 27 Hiche hi ama doubol ho hung kipatna thusim chu ahi. Solomon hin inlen pang’a in neocha chaho ana sahphat a chule apa David khopi pal ho chu ana semphat ahi.  
\v 28 Jeroboam chu thilbol theitah gollhang khat ahi ti ahin hedoh tan, chule apottho dan ho chu Solomon’in amu doh phat in, Joseph chateni Ephraim leh Manasseh phung’a konna engbolna-a natong ho chung’a vaihom in ana pansah tan ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Nikhat hi Jeroboam chun Jerusalem adalhah a ahung potdoh leh Shiloh a konna hung Ahijah themgaopa chun lampia ahung chu amun ahi. Ahijah chu ponchol athahbeh a ana kivonin, amani changseh chu gamlah a ana kimuto lhon'in ahi.  
\v 30 Ahijah chun asangkhol chol thahleh chu asattel in boh som le ni ason ahi.  
\v 31 Chuin Jeroboam jah a, “Hiche ponhal som hi kilah in, ajeh chu Pakai Israel Pathen'in, ‘Solomon khut a kon’a Lenggam hi lahpeh ing kating, phungsom hi nang kapeh ding ahi,’  
\v 32 Ahinla, keiman Israel gam pumpia konna ka lhendoh khopi Jerusalem jeh leh ka lhachapa David jeh a Solomon hi phungkhat vang kakhen peh ding ahi.  
\v 33 Ajeh chu Solomon in keima einungsun in Sidon mite numei pathen Ashtoreth ahouvin, Moab mite semthu pathen Chemosh ahouvin, Ammon mite semthu pathen Molech ahouvin ahi. Aman ka lampi ajui tapon chuleh ka mitmua ka lungdei abol tapon chukitleh apa David in eijui bangin eijui pon ka chonna dan ho leh ka dan sem ho jong anit tapon ahi.   
\p
\v 34 Ahinlah keiman tu tadi a hi Solomon a kon'a alenggam hi abon'a ka lahdoh louding ahi. Keiman kana lhendoh, ka lhachapa David in kathu angaija ka dan ho anit jeh in, ama jal in Solomon hi ahinkho lhumkeiya lamkaija kakoi jing ding ahi.  
\v 35 Ahinlah achapa a konna lenggam hi ka lahdoh a phungsom hi nang khut a ka pehdoh ding ahi.  
\v 36 Achapa hi phungkhat vang chang ding ahi. Hitia chu David chilhah khat vang'in kamin loupina dinga ka lhendoh hiche Jerusalem a hi thaomei vah bang’a vah jing ding ahi.  
\v 37 Keiman nangma hi Israel te leng mun’a hi ka tousah ding chuteng nangman lungna chim’a vai nahop ding ahi.  
\v 38 Nangin kathu na ngaiya chule ka lunglhaina a neijuiya, ka lhachapa David bang’a ka Dan sem najuiya, ka thupeh nanit jing’a ahileh, Keiman kaumpi jing ding ka sohpa David kabol peh bang’a keiman nang ding’a jong na chilhah te hi amang theilou dinga ka tundoh peh ding chule Israel hi nangma kapeh ding nahi.  
\v 39 Solomon chonset jeh a hi keiman David chilhah tehi ka engbol ding ahinlah hichu phat chomkhat a ding bou ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 40 Hijeh hin Solomon in Jeroboam chu tha ding agon ahinla Jeroboam Egypt lengpa Shishak kom'a ajamlut in Solomon thi kahsen aga um tan ahi.   
\s1 Solomon Thi  
\p
\v 41 Hiche hin Solomon vaihom sunga thil abol ho leh anatoh ho chule achihna ho chu \it Solomon natoh ho kijihlutnsa Lekhabu\it* a akijihlut sohkei jin ahi.  
\v 42 Solomon in Jerusalem ah kum somli vai ana hom e.  
\v 43 Ama athi phat in apa minna kisah David khopia ana kivui tan ahi. Chu jouvin achapa Rehoboam chu ama khel in leng ahungchang tai.   
\c 12  
\s1 Sahlam Israel Phungho Kiphin  
\p
\v 1 Rehoboam chu Shechem’ah aga chen, hichea chun Israel pumpi’n ama chu leng chansah dingin ana kikhom khom uvin ahi.  
\v 2 Nebat chapa Jeroboam chun hichu ajah phat in Egypt a kon'in ahung kile tan ahi. Ama chu Solomon lengpa a konna Egypt a chu ana jamlut na ahi.  
\v 3 Israel lamkai ten ama chu ana kouvun hiti chun Jeroboam chu Israel pumpi chutoh Rehoboam toh kihoulim khom dingin ana cheuvin ahi.  
\v 4 Ama hon ajah a, “Napa Solomon chun eina bolgim lheh jengun ahi. Hijeh chun napa in poh hahsasa eikoiden un nangin nasuh lhomjep a nomdom a neilhau le na lenggam a kitahtah in pang unge,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 5 Rehoboam in adonbut in, “Hiche thu a hin kingaitona ding nithum phat neipeuvin, chujou tengleh ka donbutna ngai dingin hung kit tauvin,” ati. Hichun mipi ho jong akile tauve.   
\p
\v 6 Hichun Rehoboam lengpa chun apa Solomon thumop a anapang upaho chu ana kihou pin, “Hiche thua hi ipi nagel uvem? Iti ka donbut ding ham nei seipeh un,” ati.   
\p
\v 7 Hichun upaho chun adonbut un, “Nangin amaho chunga hi na vaihom nom jing’a ahile adei bang uvin donbut in chuti leh amaho hi nangma midih tah hijing diu ahi,” atipeh uve.   
\p
\v 8 Ahinlah Rehoboam in tehseho thumop la louvin khangdong ama toh hung seilen khomho ama thumop a hung pang ho joh chu ipi nagel uvem tin ana dong tan ahi.  
\v 9 Aman amaho jah a chun, “Hiche mipi hon napan kachung uva pohgih eipoh sah uhi neisuh lhompeh un atiu hi, iti ka donbut ding ham?” tin ana dongin ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Hiche khangthah ho chun, “Pohgih nei suhlhom peh un tia phun ho chu hitin donbut in, ‘Ka khut jung neocha hi kapa kong sang'in asa jon ahi.  
\v 11 Kapan na chung uva pohgih na-na pohsah u chu keiman ka gihsah cheh ding ahi. Kapan khaojanga najep u ahi, kenvang sakol jepna a kajep diu nahiuve tipeh in,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 12 Jeroboam le mipi ho chu abonchauvin Rehoboam in a thupeh bang bangin nithum chanin lengpa thupeh ngai dingin ahung kit tauvin ahi.  
\v 13 Ahin Rehoboam in amaho kom'a chun upaho thumop lalouvin, ngailou tah in thu ana sei tan  
\v 14 aman akhangthah chanpi ho thumop joh chu ana sangin, “Kapan pohgih na-na pohsah uchu tunia hi keiman ka gihsah cheh ding ahi. Kapan khaova najep u ahin keiman sakol jepna a kajep diu nahiuve!” tin ana donbut tan ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Hiti chun lengpan mipite chu nahsah louvin anakoi tan ahi. Hitobang thilsoh hi Pathen thilgon ahi. Ajeh chu Shiloh a konna hung Ahizah Themgao mangcha a Pakaijin Nebat chapa Jeroboam kom’a athu hetsah chu guilhunna ding thilsoh ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Israel mipi ten lengpa kom’a ataonau chu asanpeh tapoi ti ahet phat’un, ama hon hitin adonbut tauve,  
\b  
\q1 “David insung mite mangthah uhen!  
\q2 Jesse chapa chungah lunglutna kanei tapouve,  
\q1 Vo Israel, inlam kijot tauvin!  
\q2 Vo David! Nangin na insung bou kivet tan,” tin asam un,  
\b  
\p hiti chun Israel mipi chu a inlam cheh uva akile tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 12:16 \xt 2 Samuel 20:1\x*  
\v 17 Ahinlah Rehoboam in Judah khopi ho cheng Israel ho chung’a chun vai ana hom nalai jin ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Rehoboam in namna a natongho chunga vaihompa chu mipi thunun ding chun agah sol’in ahile ama chu mipi hon songin ana seplih tauvin ahi. Hiche thu chu Rehoboam lengpan ajahdoh phat in asakol kangtalai chung’a akaldoh loijin Jerusalem lang’a ajam tan ahi.  
\v 19 Hiche apat hin sahlam gamkai’a um Israel phungho jousen David chilhah khat in achung uva vai ahop dingu chu anom tapouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Israel mipi ten Jeroboam chu Egypt a kon'in ahung kilekit tai ti ajahphat un, kikhopna aneiyun, ama chu Israel pumpi chung’a vaipo din atung tauvin ahi. Judah phung bou chun David chilhah te apanpi uvin ahi.   
\s1 Shemaiah Gao Thusei  
\p
\v 21 Rehoboam chu Jerusalem alhung phat in, aman Judah le Benjamin phung’a kon'in achomkhom in alenggam tundoh kitna ding’a Israel mite sat dingin sepai 180,000 alhengdoh in ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Ahinlah Pathen'in Pathen mipa Shemaiah kom’ah hitin ahin seije,  
\v 23 “Benjamin le Judah mipite ho jouse kom le Judah lengpa Solomon chapa Rehoboam kom leh mipi adang jouse kom’ah seijin,  
\v 24 ‘Pathen'in hitin aseiye, nasopi Israel tehi kisatpi hih in, na incheh uva kile tauvin ajeh chu hiche hi keima natoh ahi!’ ati. Hiti chun Pakai thupeh chu ajuiyun ama-ama inlam cheh a akile tauvin ahi.   
\s1 Jeroboam In Sana Bongnou Lim Asem  
\p
\v 25 Jeroboam in Ephraim thinglhang gam’ah Shechem khopi chu ana tungdoh in, hichu ama leng khopi ahung hitan ahi. Hijou chun ama achen Peniel khopi jong aga tungdoh in ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Jeroboam chu akingaiton, “Keima ka chih theilou leh hiche lenggam hi David chilhah te langa le lut kit thei ahi.  
\v 27 Hiche mipite hi Jerusalem'a ache uva Pakai Hou-In a kilhaina agabol jing uva ahileh, Judah lengpa Rehoboam noiyah avel in hunglut kit get unte, chuleh keima hi eitha uva ama hi aleng uva akilahlut kit diu ahi,” tin ana gel in ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Hijeh chun amiching ho thumop dungjuijin, lengpa chun sana in bongnou lim asemin amite kom’a, “Jerusalem'a Pathen houva nache jiu hi ahahsa behseh e, veuvin Israel te Egypt a konna nahin puidoh uva chu hiche pathen teni hi ahi,” ati peh in ahi. \x + \xo 12:28 \xt Potdohbu 32:4\x*   
\p
\v 29 Aman hiche semthu bongnou lim pathen teni hi Bethel khopi ah khat chule Dan khopi ah khat akoiyin ahi.  
\v 30 Ahinlah hiche chu amaho din chonsetna nasatah ahung hikha tai, ajeh chu mipin bongnou limsemthu chu ahou tauvin ahi, chule mipi ho chu Dan langpeh a chetouva hiche semthu pathen kikoi chu aga hou jiu ahi.   
\p
\v 31 Jeroboam in semthu pathen houna mun achun doiphung phabep atungdoh in, Levi phungmi hilou milham phabep jong thempu in athenso tan ahi.  
\v 32 Chule Jeroboam in Bethel khopiah houthudol kut khat jong ana pandoh in, hichu lhaget channa nisom le nga nileh ana boljin ahi. Hichu Judah ten hoidohna golvah kum khat a khatvei aboljiu tobang ahi. Bethel mun'a chun ama tah in jong bongnou lim asemna achun kilhaina asemin chuleh semthu pathen houna in achun thempu phabep jong ana pansah in ahi. \x + \xo 12:32 \xt Thempu Dan 23:33,34\x*  
\v 33 Hijeh chun, ama tah in anagon nikho, lhaget lhinna nisom le nga channa alhin teng Jeroboam ama tah in Bethel a kilhaina maicham gantha ama lungdei tah in anabol jin, aman Israel te hou thudol’a kut ana phudoh a ama tah in kilhaina gantha maicham chungah anabol’a, gimnamtui jong ana lhutnam ji ahi.   
\c 13  
\s1 Themgao Hon Jeroboam Apai-U  
\p
\v 1 Pakai thupeh dungjuijin, Pathen mikhat Judah a kon'in Bethel’ah ahungin, Jeroboam in maicham ajot a gimnamtui hal ding agot laitah in aga lhungin ahi.  
\v 2 Hichun Pakai thupeh dungjuijin apengjah jengin, “Vo maicham, maicham! Pakaijin hitin aseiye, ‘David chilhah lah a Josiah kiti khat hung peng ding ahi. Ama hin tua chep tanloute maicham a lhacha a pangji ho, na chunga kilhaina gan thatji thempu ho hi nangma chunga athagam ding chule na chunga hi mihem gule chang hung kilhut vam ding ahi, tin ahung seije,” ati. \x + \xo 13:2 \xt 2 Lengte 23:15,16\x*  
\v 3 Hiche nikho mama chun Pathen'in athupeh adih ahi hetthei nan, melchihna khat apen ahi. Aman ajah a, “Pakaijin hiche melchihna hi pedingin kitepna aneiye; hiche maicham hi kehni hung kiso ding chule avutvam ho chu tol’a hung kithe lha ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 4 Jeroboam Lengpan Bethel maicham douna hung kisei chu ajah phat in, themgaopa chu akoh-in, “Hiche pa chu man un!” tin ahinsam tan ahi. Ahinlah hiche pettah chun lengpa khut chu ahung ngoijin adingden tan, anung lahdoh jou tapon ahi.  
\v 5 Hiche pettah chun maicham chu ahung lengkeh jengin, Pathen mipan aseibang bangin maicham sunga kon chun vutvam jouse chu ahung kibo lhan ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Lengpa chu Pathen mipa kom’a ahung peng jah jengin, “Lungset tah in Pakai na Pathen heng’a ka khut adamtheina dingin nei taopeh tan!” ati. Hichun Pathen mipa chu Pakai kom’a atao tan ahile Lengpa khut chu adamhel jengin achat le thei tan ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Hichun Lengpan Pathen mipa kom'a chun, “Hungin ka inlang’a che hitin, an hung nen lang kipa thilpeh jong nape ing’e,” ati.   
\p
\v 8 Pathen mipan lengpa kom achun, “Na lenggam akeh khat neipeh ding hijongleh nang toh kilhon khom pong’e, keiman hiche mun’a hi neh le chah kahol louding ahi,  
\v 9 Ajeh chu Pakaijin, nangman hiche mun a naum laisea neh le chah nahol louding chuleh hiche lampi ma-ma a hi Judah gam nahung kile kit ding ahi, tin thupeh einei jin ahi,” ati.  
\v 10 Hijeh chun aman Bethel adalhan lam chom aho in a inlang ajon tan ahi.   
\s1 Bethel’a Themgao Tehse  
\p
\v 11 Hiche pet hin Bethel mun'a chun themgao tehse khat ana chengin, chuin achapa te chu a inmun’u ahunglhun phat un, Bethel a Pathen mipan athilbol ho chu ana seipeh tan ahi. Chuleh hiche lengpa kom’a athusei ho jong chu aseipeh un ahi.  
\v 12 Hichun tehsepu chun, “Hoilang che tantem?” tin adongin ahileh, ama hon Pathen mipan hoiche lang pen aho ham tichu apau chu ana seipeh un ahi.  
\v 13 Tehsepu chun achate kom'ah, “Gangtah in sangan chung’a chun toupha nei koipeh loiyun,” atin ahile achaten sangan chunga chun toupha chu akoipeh un, ama jong atoudoh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Pathen mipa chu adeltan ahileh, ama chu thingphung lentah khat noija ana tou agamudoh in ahi. Tehsepun, “Judah gam’a konna hung Pathen mipa chu na him?” atileh  
\p aman jong, “Henge ama chu kahi naiye,” ati.   
\p
\v 15 Hichun aman Pathen mipa kom'a chun, “Hungin ka in ah bu hung nen,” ati.   
\p
\v 16 Aman adonbut in, “Ahipoi, kei hung thei pong’e, keiman hiche mun’a hi anneh twidon bol thei pong’e.  
\v 17 Ajeh chu Pakaijin hiche mun a naum laisea anneh twidon nabol louding ahi, chuleh nahung na lampi hi mangcha a nahung kile theilou ding ahi, tin ei sei peh in ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 18 Ahin tehsepun adonbut in, “Kei jong themgao khat kahi, Pakaiya kon'in vantil khat in hiche thupeh hi eihin pen: 'Ama chu na in’a pui inlang an nehsah in twi donsah in eiti,'” ati. Amavang tehsepu chun ajou asei ahi.  
\v 19 Hiti chun akinungle lhon tan, Pathen mipan tehsepu in achun an anen, twi adon tan ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Hitia chu amani atou khompet lhon chun Pakaiya kon'in Themgao tehsepu kom achun thupeh khat ahunglhung tan ahi.  
\v 21 Ama jong Judah a konna hung Pathen mipa kom'a chun apeng jah in, “Nangin Pakai thupeh chu na sukeh in, Pakai na Pathen'in thu napeh dungjuijin na chon tapoi.  
\v 22 Hilai munna nahung kilen, na nen, na donin, nehih in don hih in kati chu na sumil tai. Hiti ahijeh chun, natahsa hi napu napate lupna a kivui louding ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 23 Pathen mipan aneh a adon jouvin Themgao tehsepu chun ama sangan chunga chun toupha apha peh in,  
\v 24 hichun Pathen mipa chu akipatdoh tan ahi. Hitia chu inlam jona ache laitah in, humpi khat atoh khan athat tan ahi. Atahsa chu lamlen chung'ah akijamin, sangan le humpi chu ana ding khom lhon'in ahi.  
\v 25 Mi phabep in along lampia kijam le akom'a sakei ding atoh khauvin, hichun Themgao tehsepu umna Bethel geiyin acheuvin athilmu uchu aga seipeh tauve.   
\p
\v 26 Themgao tehsepu chun athu ajahdoh phat in, “Hiche Pathen mipa hin, Pathen thupeh anit lou ahin, Pakaijin keipi chu athasah a athusei chu asuh bulhit ahitai,” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 27 Themgaopa chun achate kom’ah, “Sangan chung’a chun toupha hin koijun,” ati. Chuti chun amaon akoipeh tauvin,  
\v 28 ama ache in, atahsa lamlen chunga lum chu agamu’n, a sangan leh humpi akom’a ana din nahlai vang'in, humpi chun ana nedeh pon chule Sangan jong chu ima ana tipon ahi.  
\v 29 Themgaopa chun Pathen mipa tahsa chu asangan chung’a chun akoiyin, khopi langa chun along op dingin ahin pon ahi.  
\v 30 Aman lhan’ah avuijin, lhase tah in akap in “Vo ka sopipa!” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 31 Hichejou chun Themgao pa chun achate kom’ah, “Keima kathi tengleh Pathen mipa kivuina lhan ah hin neihin vui uvin lang, kagu hi ama gu panga hin lupsah un,” ati.  
\v 32 “Ajeh chu Pakaijin Samaria khopi sung’a khopi ho lah a kisemdoh semthu pathen houna maicham leh Bethel maicham douna Pakaijin ana phondohsa chu guilhung tei ding hija ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 33 Ahivangin hitobang thilsoh nung jengin jong, Jeroboam chu athilse bolna a kon'in akihei mang dehpon ahi. Aman milham lah a kon'in thempu ana lheng jing nalaiyin ahi. Semthu pathen houna doiphung’a thempu dingin apang nom jouse ana pansah jengin ahi.  
\v 34 Hiche hi chonset nasatah ahung hitan chule Jeroboam chilhah ho leiset chunga kon'in suhmang in aumlo tan ahi.   
\c 14  
\s1 Ahijah In Jeroboam Douna a Gaothu Asei  
\p
\v 1 Hichun Jeroboam chapa Abijah ahung dammo tan ahi.  
\v 2 Jeroboam in ajinu kom'a, “Keima ji nahi hi min nahetdoh louna dingin kisem inlang, Shiloh a themgao Ahijah kom’ah gachen, ama chun leng kahung chan ding hi eina seipeh ahi.  
\v 3 Changlhah pheng som toh changlhah lum themkhat, khoiju thei khat toh po inlang ichapa khankho ding hi gadong tan,” ati.   
\p
\v 4 Hiti chun Jeroboam jinu chu Shiloh a Ahijah kom’ah aga chen ahi. Ama chu ana teh lheh tan, kho jong amuchen thei tapoi.  
\v 5 Ahinlah Pathen'in Ahijah jah ah, “Jeroboam jinu chu lim chompu a hikom'a hi hung ding ahi. Aman achapa damlouna chung chang’a khu na hungdoh ding ahin adonbutna dia kahilchah bang’a na-na donbut ding ahi,” atipeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Ahin Jeroboam jinun Ahijah kot chu ahin phah chu ajah phat in, “Jeroboam jinu, ipi dinga midang dan’a na kilepma nahung ham? Hunglut in,” ati. Hijou chun aman, “Keiman na jah ding thungailou khat ka seipeh nom’e,” ati.  
\v 7 “Najipa Jeroboam chu ana seipeh in, Pakai Israel Pathen'in najah sah nom chu hiche hi ahi. ‘Keiman nangma hi milham’a konna ka dopsang’a kami Israel te chunga vaihom a kapansah nahin,  
\v 8 keiman David insunga kon’a lenggam kahe lhah a, nangma kapeh nahi. Ahinla nangma hi ka lhachapa David toh nabang pon ahi. Aman vang phattin in ka lungdei lamtah in ka thupeh jouse hi alungthim pumpin ajui jingin ahi.  
\v 9 Nangin vang nang masanga vaihom jouse sangin thilse nabol jon ahi. Nangman nang dingin semthu pathen ho nakisem in, na sana bongnou lim sem ho hin eiphin lunghang tan ahi. Nangin nei nungsun ahitah jeh in,  
\v 10 Keiman na chilhah ho chung’a hamsetna ka chuhsah ding chuleh na chilhah pasal jouse ka suhmang ding, soh hihen hilou hijongleh Israel lah a muntin’a na leng chilhah ho jouse aboncha kaban suhmang sohkei ding ahi. \x + \xo 14:10 \xt 1 Lgt 15:29\x*  
\v 11 Jeroboam insung mite kholaiya thiden jouse, uichan aneh chai ding chule gam lah a thiho jouse chu muthong in aneh sohkei ding ahi,’ tin Pakaijin aseiye,” ati.   
\p
\v 12 Hijou chun Ahijah in Jeroboam jinu kom'ah, “Na inlang’a chetan khopi chu nalhun lhun le na chapa chu thi ding ahi.  
\v 13 Israel pumpin lunghempi uvin tin avui diu ahi, na insung’a phatecha kivuijah ama bou hung hi ding ahi. Ajeh chu Jeroboam insung pumpia hiche chapangpa bou hi Pakai Israel Pathen'in alunglhaina a amu ahi bouve,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 “Hiche banna hin Pakaijin Israel a kon'in lengkhat hin tungdoh intin, ama chun Jeroboam insung pumpi asuhmang ding ahi.  
\v 15 Hiteng chuleh Pakaijin Israel chu luidung’a pumpeng kiling bang’a lonle le ding ahiuve, chuleh Israel te hi apu apateu ana pehna gampha a kon’a abodoh ding chuteng Euphrates vadung gallang peh a athe cheh ding ahi. Ajeh chu ama hon semthu pathen Asherah pou ahouvun ahi.  
\v 16 Jeroboam in Israel hi achonset sah jeh chun Pakaijin Israel pumpi hi adalhah ding ahitai.   
\p
\v 17 Hijeh chun Jeroboam jinu Tirzah langa akile in a insung agah chot lut-lut achun chapangpa chu athi tan ahi.  
\v 18 Israel pumpin alunghempi uvin, Pakaijin Ahijah a phondohsah bang bangin avui tauvin ahi.   
\s1 Jeroboam Thi  
\p
\v 19 Jeroboam vaihom laija thilsoh dang ho jouse agalsat le avaihomna pum in \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu\it*a akijihlut sohkei jin ahi.  
\v 20 Jeroboam in Israel te chunga kum somni vai ana hom in ahi. Jeroboam athi phat in achapa Nadab leng ahung chang tan ahi.   
\s1 Rehoboam In Judah Gam'a Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 21 Alangkhat a Solomon chapa Rehoboam Judah lengpa chu leng ahung chan chun kum somli le khat anahi tai. Aman Pakai khopi Jerusalem'a kum som le sagi vai ana hom in ahi. Hiche khopi hi Pakaijin ama loupina dinga Israel phung jouse lah a kon’a ahin lhendoh ahi. Rehoboam nu chu Amon gam mi Naamah ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Rehoboam vaihom sung hin Judah mipi ten Pakai mitmu'n thilse jeng anabol un, achonset nauvin Pakai ana lunghansah un ahi. Ajeh chu apu apateu sang'in thilse ana habol joh un ahi.  
\v 23 Ajeh chu ama hon muntin’ah milim semthu houna doiphung ho ana semdoh un chuleh thinglim noi tin le thinglhang sang tin ah Asherah doiphung ana tungdoh un ahi. \x + \xo 14:23 \xt 2 Lengte 17:9,10\x*  
\v 24 Gamsung jousea pasal leh numei kijoh ho doiphung jong anasem un ahi. Pakaijin Israel te masang’a ana nodohsa milim hou nam mite kidah umtah a achonna hou ana juijun ahi. \x + \xo 14:24 \xt Danbu Ni Na 23:17\x*   
\p
\v 25 Rehoboam lengpa vaihom kum nga chanin Egypt lengpa Shishak chun Jerusalem ahin nokhum in ahi. \x + \xo 14:25 \xt 2 Thusimbu 12:2-8\x*  
\v 26 Aman leng inpi sung le Pakai Hou-In sunga sum kholna jouse ana chom ngimsel’in, Solomon in ana sem sana ompho ho jouse jong achom ngimsel tan ahi. \x + \xo 14:26 \xt 1 Lgt 10:16,17; 2 Thusimbu 9:15,16\x*  
\v 27 Rehoboam Lengpan hiche ompho chu sum-eng ana semin ana koi khel in ahi, hiche ho chu leng inpi ngah apipui hon anga tup diuvin angansen ahi.  
\v 28 Lengpa chu Pakai Hou-In a acheji phat tengleh hiche ompho ho chu ahin ladoh jiuvin chujou tengleh in-ngah ho umna indan sunga akoiji uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Rehoboam vaihom sung’a thilsoh adang ho jouse chu \it Judah Lengte Thusimbu\it* achun akijihlut sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 30 Rehoboam le Jeroboam kikah a gal ana kisat matchet jingin ahi.  
\v 31 Rehoboam chu athi phat in apu apate toh David khopia anavui un ahi. Rehoboam nu chu Amon gam mi Naamah ahi. Ama bannah achapa Abijah leng ahung chang tan ahi.   
\c 15  
\s1 Abijah In Judah Gam Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 1 Jeroboam in Israel chunga avaihomna kum som le get lhin kum in, Abijam chu Judah te chung’ah vaihom in ahung pang in ahi.  
\v 2 Aman Jerusalem ah kum thum vai ana hom in ahi. Anu chu Absalom chanu Maacah ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Aman jong, ama masanga leng vaihom ho bang bangin, thilse jeng anabol in, apului David kitah bangin a Pakai a Pathen ah ana kitah joupon ahi.  
\v 4 Ahin David jal’a, Pakai a Pathen'in achilhah te aban banna thaomei vah banga vah dinga vaihomna mun ahin ban losah ahin, achapa Abijam jong chu ama nunga Jerusalem'a vai ahin hop sah ahi. \x + \xo 15:4 \xt 1 Lgt 11:36\x*  
\v 5 Ajeh chu David in a Pakai mitmu a apha jeng anabol’a, Pakai thupeh hoitah a ahinkho lhumkeiya ana jui lhungkei ahin, Hit mi Uriah chung’a ana kipal bou chu ahi. \x + \xo 15:5 \xt 2 Samuel 11:1-27\x*   
\p
\v 6 Hiche Abijam leh Jeroboam vaihom sung hin akikah lhon ah gal kisattona ana um mat chat in ahi. \x + \xo 15:6 \xt 2 Thusimbu 13:3-21\x*  
\v 7 Abijam vaihom sunga thilsoh dang ho \it Judah Lengte Thusimbu\it* a aum sohkei jin ahi. Abijam le Jeroboam kikah a gal ana um jingin ahi.  
\v 8 Abijam athi phat in David khopia ana kivuijin ahi. Hijou chun achapa Asa chu leng ahung chang in ahi.   
\s1 Asa In Judah Gam Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 9 Jeroboam in Israel chung’a vai ana hom na kum somni ahung lhin hin, Judah chung’a Asa in vai ahin hom panin ahi.  
\v 10 Aman Jerusalem'a kum somli le khat vai ana hom in ahi. Api chu Maacah ahin, Abshalom tunu ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Asa hin apului David bangin Pakai mitmun alung lhaina ngen anabol'in ahi.  
\v 12 Aman gamsunga numei pasal kijoh ho doiphung ho jouse chu ana paidoh in chuleh apu apaten ana hou u doiho jong asumang gam’in ahi. \x + \xo 15:12 \xt 2 Thusimbu 15:8-15\x*  
\v 13 Aman api Maacah jeng jong lengnu nu ahina a kon'in ana haisah in ahi, ajeh chu aman thet umtah Asherah doi ana kisem jeh ahi. Aman kidah umtah adoi ho chu asat lhan Kidron phaicham lamah aga hal lhan ahi.  
\v 14 Aman doiphung ho jouse chu ana suhmang lou vang'in, aman ahinkho lhung keijin kitah tah in Pakai anajui lhung keijin ahi.  
\v 15 Apa leh aman sana le dangka chuleh thil dang-dang ho ahin ana katdohsa lhon ho chu Pakai Hou-In'a ana polut in ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Judah lengpa Asa leh Israel lengpa Baasha teni kikah a gal anaum jingin ahi.  
\v 17 Israel leng Baasha in Judah gam ahinsat in, Judah te leng Asa gamsunga mi alut le apot aum thei louna dingin Ramah chu kulpi aget khumin ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Asa in hiche lethuhna in Pakai Hou-In sung le leng inpia sum kholna a sana dangka ho jouse chu aladoh in, hichu Hezion tupa Ben-Hadad , Tabrimmon chapa Aram lengpa chu aga pehsah in thu hicheng jong athot in ahi.   
\b  
\pmo
\v 19 “Napa le kapa kikah a kinoptona anaum bang-bang chun, tunjong nang le kei kikah ajong kinoptona nei hite. Ven keiman sana le dangka kipa thilpeh kahin thot in ahi. Israel Lengpa Baasha toh kinoptona nanei lhon chu sukeh in, chutileh aman keima eidalhan tin eisuboi taponte,” ati.   
\b  
\p
\v 20 Asa Lengpa tepna chu Ben-Hadad in jong ana noppeh in, Israel khopi ho nokhum dingin asepai te asoltan ahi. Hiti chun ama hon Ijon, Dan, Abel-beth-maacah chuleh Kinnereth pumpi leh Naphtali gam pumpi ana banjo gam tauvin ahi.  
\v 21 Israel Lengpa Baasha chun thilsoh ho chu ajahdoh phat in, Ramah khopi chu kulpi akaikhumna a kon chun akinungle in Tirzah langa achetan ahi.  
\v 22 Hichun Asa lengpa Judah gamsung a mijousen Baasha in Ramah aumkhum kulpi semna a amanchah thing le song ho chu lhoh mang dingin thu apen ahi. Asa in hiche ho chu Benjamin gamsunga um Giba khopi leh Mizpah khopi pal getkhumna in amang tan ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Asa vaihomna sunga thilsoh ho leh athaneina dungjuiya anatoh le thilbol ho chuleh khopi ana tundoh min ho chu \it Judah Lengte Thusimbu\it*a kijihlutna Lekhabua chun aum'in ahi. Ateh langin akeng ahung natan ahi.  
\v 24 Asa athi phat in ama chu apu apate toh David khopiah anavui tauvin ahi.  
\p Hijeh chun Asa chapa Jehosaphat chun leng mun ahin lotan ahi.   
\s1 Nadab In Israel Gam Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 25 Judah mite lah a Asa lengpan vai ahom akum ni channa in Jeroboam chapa Nadab chun Israel te lah a vai ana hom in ahi. Aman Israel te lah a kumni vai ahom in ahi.  
\v 26 Aman Pakai mitmu’n thilse jeng anabol’in, apa natoh nung ana juijin, Jeroboam in Israel te ana chonset sah chu ana chejompi in ahi.   
\p
\v 27 Hijou chun, Issachar phunga konna Ahijah chapa Baasha chun Nadab chu tha ding ana gon, aman asepai te toh Gibbethon kiti Philistine khopia chu ana nokhum got laitah in ana that tan ahi.  
\v 28 Asa lengpan Judah mite lah a vai ana hopna kum thum channa in Baasha in Nadab ana that in Israel te leng in ana pangin ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Aman Jeroboam chilhah te abonchan ana that gamin, leng insunga mite chu khatcha ana hinghoi pon ahi. Hiche hi Pakaijin Shiloh a Ahijah themgaopa mangcha a Jeroboam chung chang thu ana sei chu aguilhunna ahitai. \x + \xo 15:29 \xt 1 Lgt 14:10\x*  
\v 30 Hitobang thilsoh hi Jeroboam in Pakai Israel Pathen chu asuh lunghang jeh leh ama chonsetna chungchon na Israel mipite chu ana chonset sah jeh ahi.   
\p
\v 31 Nadab in avaihom sunga thilsoh ho leh aman anatoh thil ho \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu\it* a aum'in ahi.   
\s1 Baasha In Israel Gam Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 32 Judah lengpa Asa leh Israel lengpa Baasha kikah a kidouna anaum jingin ahi.  
\v 33 Judah gam’a Asa lengpan vai ahom kum thum channa in Ahijah chapa Baasha in Israel gam pumpia vai ana hom in ahi. Baasha in Tirzah a kum somni le li vai ana hom in ahi.  
\v 34 Ahin, aman Jeroboam chonna bangin Pakai mitmu’n thilse jeng ana bollin, Jeroboam in Israel te ana chonset sah chu aman jong ana chejom pin ahi.   
\c 16  
\p
\v 1 Hiche hi Pakaiya konna Hanani chapa Jehu Themgao mangcha a Baasha Lengpa kom'a thupeh ahi.  
\v 2 “Keiman nangma hi vutvai lah a konna katundoh a kami Israel te chunga vaihom’a ka pansah nahi, ahinlah nangin Jeroboam setna lampi najuijin nangin jong Israel te hi na chonset sah in kalung na hansah tan ahi.  
\v 3 Hijeh chun keiman Nebat chapa Jeroboam chilhah te ka suhmang bang’a nang le na insung mite jong ka suhmang ding ahi.  
\v 4 Baasha insung mite khopi sunga thiden ho chu, uicha ten aneh diu, gamlah a thiho chu muthong ten aneh diu ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 5 Baasha'n vai ahom sunga thilsoh ho chuleh aman athaneina a ana tohdoh ho \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu\it* a aum'in ahi.  
\v 6 Baasha athi phat chun, Tirzah mun'ah avui tauvin ahi. Hijou chun achapa Elah chu ama khel in leng ahung changtan ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Hanani chapa themgao Jehu mangchan Pakaijin Baasha leh a insung mite dounan thu ana seijin ahi. Baasha in Jeroboam leh a insung miten atohbang bang’a Pakai doumah ana boljeh a agihna thu hi ana peh ahin, chuleh hiche Baasha hin Jeroboam insung mite aboncha ana thagam ahi. Pakai lunghanna chu Baasha chunga ana deojah jengin ahi.   
\s1 Elah In Israel Gam Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 8 Asa lengpan Judah mite lah a vai apoh kum somni le gup channan, Baasha chapa Elah hin Israel chunga vai ahin hompan tan ahi. Aman Tirzah khopia kumni vai ana hom in ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Hijou chun lengte galsatna sakol kangtalai ho akehkhat chung’a lamkai Zimri chun ama chu tha ding ana gongin ahi. Tirzah khopia nikhat hi Elah chu khopi sung vaipopa Arza insung a ju ana kham in,  
\v 10 Zimri chu avahlut in asat lhun athat tai. Hiche hi Asa lengpan Judah mite lah a aleng chan kum somni le sagi alhinna thilsoh ahi. Hichun Zimri chu leng ahung chang tan ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Zimri hin Baasha insung mite jouse gangtah in ana that jou keijin pasal chapang neokhat cha jeng jong ana hinghoi tapon ahi. Aman a insung lamdol a akinaipi behseh jong hilou chuleh agol apaiho kisan ana that in ahi.  
\v 12 Hiti hin Pakaijin Jehu themgao mangcha a ana phondohsa bangin, Zimri hin Baasha chilhah ho jouse jong ana sumang soh tan ahi.  
\v 13 Hiche thilsoh hi Baasha leh achapa Elah chonset jeh leh Israel achonset sah lhon jeh ahi. Hitia hi manlou semthu doilim ho jeh a Pakai Israel Pathen chu ana suh lunghang’u ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Elah vaihom sunga thilsoh ho leh ana tohdoh ho jouse chu \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu\it*a akijihlut sohkeijin ahi.   
\s1 Zimri In Israel Gam Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 15 Judah gam'a Asa in lengvai apohna kum somni le sagi lhin kum hin, Israel pumpia Zimri in vai ahin hom in ahinlah Tirzah khopia nisagi bou vai ana homin ahi. Israel sepai ten Philistine khopi Gibbethon chu ana nokhum'un ahi.  
\v 16 Ama hon Zimri in kitahlou tah in lengpa athat tai tithu ajah phat un, hiche nikho ma-ma chun sepai lamkai Omri chu Israel te Leng dingin ana lhengdoh tauvin ahi.  
\v 17 Hiti chun Omri in Israel galmi pumpi chu ahin lamkaijin Gibbethon a kon'in Tirzah ahin nokhum tauvin ahi.  
\v 18 Zimri chun khopi chu alatai ti ahetphat un, hiche khopia chun achen ama le ama meikong akihal khumin athi tan ahi.  
\v 19 Ajeh chu ama jong hin, Pakai mitmu’n thilse jeng anabol’in ahi. Aman jong Jeroboam in Israel te ana chonset sah tobang chun ana chepin ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Zimri vaihom sunga thilsoh ho leh aman dan dihlou tah a na anatohna ho jouse \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu\it*a akijihlut sohkeijin ahi.   
\s1 Omri In Israel Gam Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 21 Ahinlah tuhin Israel te kehni akiso tauvin ahi. Mipi akeh khat in Ginath chapa Tibni chu achung uva lenga pang din adeijun ahinlah akeh khat in Omri joh chu adeijun ahi.  
\v 22 Ahin Omri deiho chun Tibni deiho chu ajou tauvin ahi. Hichun Tibni chu athat tauvin Omri joh chun lengmun ahinlo tan ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Judah gam'a Asa leng chan kum somthum le khat alhin chun, Omri in Israel te lah a vai ahin hompan tan ahi. Aman kum som le ni vai ana hom in kum gup chu Tirzah a ana pansan ahi.  
\v 24 Hijou chun Omri in tua Samaria kiti thinglhang gam chu aneipa Shemer a kon'in dangka pounds 150 ape in ana kichoh doh in ahi. Aman hichu khopi khat in ana semin aneipa Shemer a kon'in Samaria ana sah ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Ahinlah Omri in ama masanga lengvaipo ho jouse sangin Pakai mitmun thilse ngen chang anabol in ahi.  
\v 26 Aman jong Nebat chapa Jeroboam chonsetna jousea Israel te ana chonset sah bangin ama jong hiti hin ana chonin ahi. Mipi ten pannabei milim ana hou uvin Israel Pathen chu ana lunghan sah tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 27 Omri vaihom sunga thilsoh dang ho chuleh athaneina chuleh ana tohdoh ho jouse chu \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu\it* achun akijihlut sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 28 Omri chu athi phat in, Samaria munna ana vuijun ahi. Ama banin achapa Ahab chun lengmun ahinlo tan ahi.   
\s1 Ahab In Israel Gam Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 29 Judah gam'a Asa leng chan kum somthum le get ahung lhin chun, Omri chu Israel te lengmun ahinlo pantan ahi. Aman Samaria mun’ah kum somni le ni sungin vai ahin hom’in ahi.  
\v 30 Omri chapa Ahab hin Pakai mitmun thilse jeng ahin bol’in, ama masang’a lengho jouse sangin thilsejo ahin boldoh in ahi.  
\v 31 Aman Jeroboam thilse bol chu anung ajui keu hilouvin, Sidon Lengpa Ethbaal chanu Jezebel chu ana kichenpin Baal doi chu ana houtan ahi.  
\v 32 Amasan Ahab in Samaria mun ah Baal doi phung leh hou-in ana tungdoh in ahi.  
\v 33 Hijou chun aman Asherah doiphung ana tungdoh kit in, hiti hin aman ama masanga leng dang ho sangin Pakai Israel Pathen chu ana phin lunghang penin ahi.   
\p
\v 34 Ahab leng vaipoh laitah in, Bethel a kon'in Hiel kitipa in Jericho ahin sempha kittan ahi. Aman inbul khom aphudoh nin achapa tahpen Abiram kitipa chun ahinkho alha tan ahi. Aman asahchaija akehkhat ahin tundoh ahin achapa lhumpenpa chun ahinkho alha tan ahi. Hiche hi Nun chapa Joshua in Pakaiya kon’a Jericho chung chang thu ana phondoh chu guilhung’a ahitai. \x + \xo 16:34 \xt Joshua 6:26\x*   
\c 17  
\s1 Elijah Themgao Va-Ah Ten Avah  
\p
\v 1 Gilead gamsung, Tishbe khoa konna hung Elijah in Ahab lengpa kom'ah, “Akin katoh jing, hingjing Pakai Israel Pathen min’a kasei ahi, ‘Keiman thu kapeh tokahsea kum phabep sunga hi gotwi leh daitwi lha louding ahi!” ati. \x + \xo 17:1 \xt Jac 5:17\x*   
\p
\v 2 Hijou chun Pakaijin Elijah kom'ah hitin ahinsei tai,  
\v 3 “Hiche mun hi dalhan lang, Jordan luigal niso lam, Kerith vadung kom'a khun gakisel tan.  
\v 4 Hiche vadung’a twi hi don inlang chuleh va-ah ten ahin poh ho chu nejingin, ajeh chu keiman an nahin pohpeh ding’a ka nganse ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 5 Elijah chun Pakaijin aseipeh bang bangin abol in, Jordan solang Kerith vadung pang’a chun apansa tan ahi.  
\v 6 Va-ah te chun jingkah nilhah in anneh ding changlhah le sa ahin pohpeh jin chuleh vacha twi chu adonjin ahi.  
\v 7 Ahin chomkhat jouvin hiche vadung jong chu akang tan ahi, ajeh chu gamsung’a go ana ju tapon ahi.   
\s1 Zarephath Khoa Maithainu  
\p
\v 8 Hiti chun Pakaijin Elijah kom’a thu ahin seiye,  
\v 9 “Nangma chen lang Sidon khopi kom’a Zarephath khoa gache tan. Nangma vah dinga Keiman meithainu kathupeh ahitai,” ati. \x + \xo 17:9 \xt Lk 4:25,26\x*   
\p
\v 10 Ama Zarephath ah achen, akhosung kelkot phung agah lhun phat in, meithai khat in thinggo ana chom amun amanu kom'a chun, “Lungset tah in khon khat a twi themkhat nei hinpe thei dem?” atin ahi.  
\v 11 Amanu chun twi agaso got leh, aman, “Changlhah themkhat jong neihin choipeh in,” ati.   
\p
\v 12 Ahin amanun jong ajah a, “Pakai na Pathen min'a kihahsel’a kasei ahi, insung’a changlhah hal khatcha jong ka neipoi, belsung’a changbong khut dimkhat seh kanei tan, hai sunga thao themcha bou kanei tai, tua thingkang themkhat kachom jong hi hiche changbong hile thao hi kasuhto a kei le ka chapa ding’a ka kan’a, ka nehjou lhon teng ka thi dinga ka gellhah lhon ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 13 Ahinlah Elijah in amanu kom'a chun, “Lunggim hih in! Nasei chu bol jengin, ahinla changlhah themkhat kei dingin hinbol masan, chujou tengleh aval chu nang le na chapa neh dingin kibol lhon nan nate.  
\v 14 Ajeh chu hiche hi Pakai Israel Pathen'in asei ahi, belsung’a changbong chun beitih anei louhel ding, haisung’a thaotwi jong chu beitih nei louva um ding, gamsung’a Pakaijin gotwi ahin juhsah masangsea hitia chu neng jing jeng ding ahi, tin aseiye,” ati.   
\p
\v 15 Hichun meithainu jong achen Elijah seibang bangin agabol tai, amanu ahin Elijah ahin, chuleh amanu insung mi ahiuvin an chu ni sottah aneuvin ahi.  
\v 16 Belsung’a an jong chu abeithei tapon, hai sunga thaotwi jong chu alhasam kha tapoi, Pakaijin Elijah jah a aseibang bangin aumtai.   
\p
\v 17 Phat chomkhat jouvin hiche numeinu chapa chu ahung dammo tai. Ama dammo chu ahungkhoh cheh-cheh jeng tan, achaina in ahung thitan ahi.  
\v 18 Hijou chun meithainun Elijah kom’ah, “Vo Pathen mipa ka chunga hi ipi nabol hitam? Hilaiya hi ka chonset ho Pathen henga phongdoh dia hikom'a hunga, ka chapa thilo sah nahim?” ati.   
\p
\v 19 Ahin Elijah in adonbut in, “Na chapa chu neihin pen,” ati. Anu pheichung’a akon chun akidop doh in, indan chung’a agejina a chun adom touvin alupna jalkhun achun alupsah in ahi.  
\v 20 Hichun Elijah chu Pakai heng’a ataovin, “Vo Pakai ka Pathen, keiman lhunna a kaneiji hiche meithainu chunga hi hamsetna na chuhsah a achapa hi nathi sah ding hitam?” ati.   
\p
\v 21 Hichun hiche chapangpa chunga chun thumvei alum’in, Pakai kom’ah chun apeng jah jengin, “O Pakai ka Pathen, lungset tah in hiche chapang hinkho hi hin kiledoh sah tei-tei jin,” ati. \x + \xo 17:21 \xt 2 Lengte 4:34,35\x*  
\v 22 Pakaijin Elijah taona chu ana ngaipeh in, hiche chapangpa hinkho chu ahin kiledoh sah in ahung hingdoh tan ahi.  
\v 23 Hichun Elijah in inchunga kon'in ahin pomsuh in anu ape in, “Ven! nacha hi ahing tai!” ati.   
\p
\v 24 Hijou chun meithainu chun Elijah kom’ah, “Tunvang keiman nangma hi Pathen mi mong-mong nahin chuleh Pakaijin nang’a hin thu asei mong-mong’e ti ka hechen tai,” ati.   
\c 18  
\s1 Carmel Mol A Kitetna  
\p
\v 1 Phat chomkhat jou, gojuh louna kum thum alhin kum in, Pakajin Elijah kom’ah, “Chenlang Ahab lengpa kom’ah, Pakaijin go ajuhsah vah ding ahitai gatin,” ati.  
\v 2 Hichun Elijah jong Ahab kom’ah achen ahi.  
\p Alangkhat na Samaria khopia chun kel ana khoh lheh jengin ahi.  
\v 3 Hijeh chun Ahab chun khopi vesuija pang Obadiah chu ana kouvin ahi. (Ama chu Pakai nungjui dihtah ahi.  
\v 4 Jezebel’in Pakai themgao jouse tha gam ding ana got lai chun, hiche Obadiah kitipa hin songko mun nia themgao jakhat ana huhdoh in ahi. Aman songko khatna mi 100 ana sellin amaho chu an le twi ana pen ahi.)  
\v 5 Ahab in Obadiah kom’ah, “Chen lang gamsung jouse gakhol sohkeijin twinah jouse gaven chuleh phaicham jouse jong gachon sohkeijin, ijeh inem itileh hamhing pouna munkhat beh imudoh uva ka sakol ho leh sakolpol phabep beh ihinso thei khat diuham,” ati.  
\v 6 Hiti chun amani chu gamsung khol ding chun akihom khen lhon'in, Ahab jong ama tah akipan in gamkai lang khat cheh jonin akihomkhen lhon tan ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Hitia chu Obadiah avale leh, photlot louvin Elijah chun ama komlang ahin jonin ahi. Obadiah chun ama chu ahepai jengin, a angsung’ah abohkhup in ahi. Aman ajah a, “Kapu Elijah na hilou haimo?” ati.   
\p
\v 8 Elijah in, “Kahinai, tun, chen lang napupa kom’ah, ‘Elijah hikom’ah aum’e’ gatin,” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Ahivangin Obadiah chun, “Ipi pen tah a keiman chonsetna kaneiya, nangman na sohpa keima hi Ahab khutna nei pehdoh a ama thasah ding neiti ham?” ati.  
\v 10 “Hingjing Pakai na Pathen min’a kasei ahi, kapu Ahab in nangma holnan leiset chunga lenggam jouse le nam jouse hi kolkimvel'a ahol soh ahitai. Elijah hikom'ah aumpoi tihi ama kom alhut teng ule hiche lenggam mite chu akihahsel sahji ahi.  
\v 11 Ahinla tun nangman napupa jah a, ‘Elijah hikom'ah aum’e’ gatin neiti.  
\v 12 Ahin nangma ka dalhah lhah teng lhagaovin nangma kahet khah louna mun khat ah, nalhoh mangkit intin, Ahab in nangma na mudoh louding ahi. Hiteng chuleh na sohpa keima hi Pathen gingtah mi kahi vang'in Ahab chun eithalo tei ding ahi.  
\v 13 Jezebel lengnun Pakai Themgao te thagam dia agot laiya, thilsoh chu koiman najah a aseilou ham? Keiman themgao ho 100 chu songko nia kana seldoh’a an le twi kana peh ahi.  
\v 14 Ahin tun nangin chenlang napupa jah a, ‘Elijah hikom'ah aum’e,’ gatin nati. Hepu, hichu kasei leh Ahab in eitha tei-tei ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 15 Ahinlah Elijah in, “Keima a angsung’a kadin jing, Pakai thaneipen minna kihahsel’a kasei ahi, tuni tah a hi Ahab chu keiman kakimupi tei ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 16 Hijeh chun Obadiah in Ahab kom’ah, “Elijah ahung’e,” aga tin ahileh, Ahab chu Elijah toh kimuto dingin achen ahi.  
\v 17 Ahab in amu phat in ahin samin, “Israel suboi jingpa nangma nahung hinam?” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Elijah in adonbut in, “Keiman Israel kasuboi poi, nangma le na insung mite in na suhboi ahi bouve, ajeh chu nangin Pakai thupeh nit louvin, Baal semthu pathen joh nahou uvin ahi.  
\v 19 Tun Israel te jouse Carmel mol’ah khom in, Baal themgao 450 toh Asherah themgao jali Jazebel in avah ho chu kouvin,” ati.   
\p
\v 20 Hiti chun Ahab in Israel mipi ho leh themgao ho chu Carmel mol ah akou khom in ahi.  
\v 21 Hichun Elijah chu amaho masang ah ading doh in, “Phat i-chanpi hi lunggel khenna nei louva lungni pua naum jom jing nahlai diu ham? Pakai hi Pathen ahi natiu leh jui jeng’un, ahinla Baal hi pathen ahi natiu leh jui jeng’un,” atin ahi. Ahinlah mipi chu athipchet jengun ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Hijou chun Elijah in amaho kom’ah aseitai, “Pakai themgao akihing hoiya keima changbou kahitai, Baal doi themgao ho vang 450 alhing uve.  
\v 23 Tun bongchal ni hin kailut uvin lang, ama hon bongchal khat kilhen masat uvin tin, that uhenlang, asemtel jou tengu leh thinglom chung’a khun koi uhen, meivang ati theilou diu ahi. Kenjong bongchal khat joh chu that ing ting thinglom chunga koi jing tin amavang mei kati louding ahi.  
\v 24 Hijou teng chuleh na pathen’u min kou un, chule keiman ka Pakai min kakou ding ahi. Hiteng chuleh mei konga hin donbut pen-pen chu, Pathen dih ahi ti hetna ahi jenge,” ati. Hichu mipi hon anop peh tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Hichun Elijah in Baal themgao ho kom'ah, “Nangho atamjo nahiuvin, bol masauvin. Bongchal khat joh chu kilhen unlang kisem un, na pathen’u chu kouvun, amavang thinglom chung’a chun mei tih hih un,” ati.   
\p
\v 26 Hiti chun ama hon bongchal khat chu alheng un, athat un, asemtoh un, maicham chunga chun akoiyun, jingkah apat sun geijin, “O Baal neihouvun” tin apeng-peng jeng tauvin ahi. Hijou chun amaho alam’un, maicham vella chun asuh chop atou chop jingun ahi.  
\v 27 Sunkim ahung hi phat in, Elijah chun amaho chu atot in, “Na hasap jep u ngai inte ajeh chu ama pathen ahin, asun imut phat ahiloule, akicholdo phat ahilouleh akhol jin pet ahilou le, a imut pet hija suhkhah ngai himai thei ahi,” ati peh’e.   
\p
\v 28 Hijeh chun ama hon, ahasap cheh, aha sap cheh jengun chuleh achon nau dungjuijin chemcha le chamjam in athiu ahung kikhodoh masang sen aki at-chen chen jengun ahi.  
\v 29 Hiti chun nilhah lam kilhai phatdon geiyin akap un apengun, ahivangin, ogin ima la aja pouvin imacha donbutna amu deh pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 30 Chutah chun Elijah jong chun mipi jouse jah a, “Nei hin nailut uvin,” atileh mipi abonchauvin ahenga ahung kikhinlut soh tauve. Hichun Elijah chun Pakai maicham akivo chimsa chu asem phan ahi.  
\v 31 Hichun aman Israel phungkhat cheh thalheng dingin songtum somle ni ana lhoh khom’in ahi. \x + \xo 18:31 \xt Semtilbu 32:28; 35:10\x*  
\v 32 Chuleh song tumho chunga chun Pakai min'in maicham ana thah semin ahi.  
\v 33 Elijah chun thinglom jong chu agol golin ajamin chuin bongchal chu asemtel tel’in, thinglom chunga chun ajamtan ahi.  
\p Hichun Elijah in aseijin, “Twi dimset set bel li gadom uvin lang, pumgo thilto chung le thinglom chunga chun chap kot sohkeijun,” ati.   
\p
\v 34 Hichu aboljou un, Elijah in, “Bol kit uvin,” atin ahileh ama hon avellin abolkit tauve. Aman asol kit in, “Thumvei lhinnan gabol kit uvin,” atia ahileh mihon jong athumvei lhinnan abolkit tauve.  
\v 35 Hiti chun maicham kimvel a chun twi along dimset tan, twilam jong chu twi adimset tan ahi.   
\p
\v 36 Nilhah lang pumgo thilto phat donin, Elijah themgao pa chu maicham mun'a akal touvin atao tan ahi. “Vo Pakai Abraham Pathen, Isaac Pathen, Jacob Pathen tuni nikhoa hin nangma hi Israel Pathen nahina leh keima hi nasohpa kahina hin phongdoh in, hiche ho jouse hi nangma thupeh a kana bol ahi jong hi hin phongdoh in.  
\v 37 “Vo Pakai, neihin donbut in! Hiche mite hin nangma hi Pakai, Pathen nahin chule nangin alungthim’u hi nanga dinga na le heipeh u ahitai tihi ahet doh diu ahi,” ati.  
\v 38 Chutah chun Pakaiya kon'in meikong ahung lenglhan, pumgo thilto bongchal sa chu akavam jengin, thinglom jong akavam jengin, leivui jong aleogo jengin, twilam’a twivei jeng jong chu ahul gohel jengin ahi.  
\v 39 Mipin hiche thilsoh hi amudoh phat uvin, amai u tol’ah asulut cheh uvin hitin asei tauve, “Pakai—ama hi Pathen ahi, ahiye, Pakai hi Pathen ahi,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 40 Hijou chun Elijah in mipi ho chu thu apen, “Baal themgao ho chu man’un, khatcha jong lhaso hih un,” ati. Hichun mipi hon amaho chu aman’un, Elijah in Kishon Phaicham a apuisuh in abonchauvin athat gamtan ahi.   
\s1 In Gojuhna Dia Elijah Taona  
\p
\v 41 Chuin Elijah chun Ahab kom'ah, “Chenlang an ganen lang twi gadon tan ajeh chu keiman gojuhna dinga van kithin husa kajatai,” ati.   
\p
\v 42 Hiti chun Ahab jong achen an anen twi adon in ahi. Ahinla Elijah chu Carmel Molchunga akaldoh in, tol achun akun chah kheh in, akhup teni kikah a amai asulut in taona aneijin ahi. \x + \xo 18:42 \xt Jac 5:18\x*   
\p
\v 43 Chuin asohpa jah a, “Chen lang twikhanglen lam khu gave tan,” ati.  
\p Hichun asohpa jong achen agaven, Elijah kom'a ahung kile kit in “Ima kamupoi” ati.  
\p Sagivei jen Elijah chun achea aga vet dingin anasol'in ahi.  
\v 44 Asagi vei channa chun asoh pan hitin aseiye, “Vetan, meilhang neo cha mihem khut phang tebep khat hi twikhanglen a kon'in ahung kitung doh e,” ati.  
\p Chuphat in Elijah chun asohpa jah a, “Ahab kom achun cheloijin lang hitin hin gaseipeh in, ‘Na sakol kangtalai ah chun kaldoh inlang na inlanga cheloijin achuti louva ahile geisang le chun gojuh in nalap ding, nache theilou ding ahi, gatipeh in!” ati.   
\p
\v 45 Hichejou jou chun, van ahung thim cheh-cheh jengin, meilom ahung kikhom khom jeng tan hui ahung nungpan tai, chuin go hajuh in ahung jun ahi. Ahab chun asakol kangtalai akitol in Jezreel henglam’ah gangtah in achetan ahi.  
\v 46 Hichun Pakaijin Elijah chu thahatna jat chombeh apen, aman jong atai akigah in, Ahab masang’ah ana kheltan in Jezreel kot phunga ana lamtin kittan ahi.   
\c 19  
\s1 Elijah Sinai Molsang Lam’a Ajam  
\p
\v 1 Ahab chu a in agalhunin, Elijah thilbol ho jouse, Baal themgao ho athagam ho jong chu Jezebel aseipeh sohkei tan ahi.  
\v 2 Hichun Jezebel in Elijah chu hiti hin thu athot tan ahi, “Jing le tuphat tah a hi Baal themgao ho na thagam banga chu keiman jong nang katha ding ahi, katha lou pou-pouleh kadoi ho hin keima eithat jeng hen,” ati.   
\p
\v 3 Chuin Elijah jong chu akicha lheh jengin, ahinkho kihuhdohna dingin ajamtan ahi. Judah khopi Beersheba langa chun achen hichea chun asohpa adalhan ahi.  
\v 4 Hijou chun ama achangseh in gamthip noiya nilhum keijin lam ajot in ahi. Ama Longlao phungnoi khat ah atouvin, athina dingin atao tan ahi. “Vo Pakai, ka khop lheh jeng tai, kahinkho hi lajeng tan ajeh chu kei jong kapu kapate sangin kaphajo dehpoi,” atin ahi. \x + \xo 19:4 \xt Jonah 4:3\x*   
\p
\v 5 Hiche Longlao phungnoi achun akumin a imu tan ahi. Ahinlah hitia chu agah imutlhah leh vantil khat in ahin tham in, hitin ahin seipeh in, “Thouvin lang an nen!” ati.  
\v 6 Elijah in jong aven ahileh alulhunna chun song el-lenglung chung'ah changlhah themkhat ana kisanggep in, Elijah chun changlhah chu anen twijong chu adonin alumkit tai.   
\p
\v 7 Chujouvin Pakai vantil chu anivei channa in ahung kit in, Elijah chu ahin tham kit in, “Thoudoh inlang an nen, achuti louleh na kholjinna ding hi nang dinga hahsa val ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 8 Hichun ama athoudoh in, twi adonin hiche anneh husan chun nisomli le jan somli sungin lam ajot in Horeb molsang geijin achen ahi.  
\v 9 Hiche munna chun Elijah songko sung khatna alut in khovah geijin agehtan ahi.  
\s1 Elijah Heng'a Pakaijin Thu Asei  
\p Ahin Pakaijin thu ahin seijin, “Elijah hikom a chu ipi nabol ham?” ahinti.   
\p
\v 10 Elijah in adonbut in, “Keima hatchungnung Pakai, Pathen kin kabolna a kalunglut behseh jengin ahi. Ahinlah Israel mipite hin namite toh nakitepnau hi asukeh un, na maicham ho asuchip un, na themgao te athat gam'un atha moh u keibou kaum tan, tun kei jengjong tha ding eigo tauvin ahi,” ati. \x + \xo 19:10 \xt Rm 11:3\x*   
\p
\v 11 Hichun Pakaijin, “Kipatdoh inlang molsang chungvum akhun ka masang’a ga ding tan,” ati. Hitia chu Elijah aga din leh Pakai chun ahin hopan, huipi hattah chu ahung nungin molsang chu atat kha jengin ahi. Hiche huinun chu ahat behseh jengin, songpi ho chu ata leh achip lah-lah jengin ahinlah huilah a chun Pakai aumpon ahi. Huinun jou chun liing akihot in ahinlah liingkihona ah jong chun Pakai aum dehpon ahi.  
\v 12 Liing kiho jou chun mei ahung kong in ahinlah Pakai chu meikong lah a jong aumpon ahi. Hiche meikong chu akichai jouvin onem hiuheovin ahung ging in,  
\v 13 Elijah chun hichu ajah phat in, amai chu apon in akikhun, apotdoh in songko kom'a chun aga dingin ahi.  
\p Ogin khat ahung ging in, “Elijah hikom mun a hi ipi bol nahim?” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Aman adonbut in, “Keiman Pakai, Pathen hatchungnung kin kabol hi ka lunglut behseh jengin, ahinlah Israel mipite hin Pakai toh akitepnau asukeh un, na maicham asuchip un na themgao te jouse athat gam'un keima bou asohcha kahin tun kei jong eithat go tauvin ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 15 Hichun Pakaijin, “Nahung na lang ma-ma a nung chekit inlang Damascus gamthip noilang khu na galhun tengleh Aram te leng dingin Hazael khu thao ganu in,” ati. \x + \xo 19:15 \xt 2 Lengte 8:7-13\x*  
\v 16 “Hiche jouteng chuleh Israel te leng dingin Nimshi tupa Jehu khu thao nu in, chuleh nang khel’a ka themgao dingin Abel-meholah khopia kon'in Shaphat chapa Elisha khu thao nu in, \x + \xo 19:16 \xt 2 Lengte 9:1-6\x*  
\v 17 Hazael a konna jamdoh chu Jehu in atha ding Jehu a konna jamdoh chu Elisha in atha ding ahi,” ati.  
\v 18 “Tujengin jong Baal masanga kun khalou leh akam a jong chop khalouhel cheh adang jasagi Israel sungah kanei nalaije,” ati. \x + \xo 19:18 \xt Rm 11:4\x*   
\s1 Pathen'in Elisha Akou  
\p
\v 19 Hiti chun Elijah chu achen, Shaphat chapa Elisha chu aloukhoina aga mun ahi. Loulaiya chun bongchal to som le ni aumin, ahin Elisha chun som le ni channa chu mangchan lou ana khoijin ahi. Elijah chun aganailut in apon chu achunga aga seplhan achemang tai.  
\v 20 Elishan jong abongchal ading teni chu adalhan, Elijah nung adel in, “Amasan kanu le kapa availhah nan gabeng chop ingting nahin jui nang’e,” aga tin ahi.  
\p Elijah in adonbut in, “Kinungle jengin, amavang ken kabol peh ipi ham gel in,” ati.   
\p
\v 21 Hichun Elisha akinung le in bongchal chu athat in aloukhoina thing chu atih in bongchal chu ahonna in amang tan ahi. Aman khopi mite akhom khomin, sa chu anehsah sohkeijin ahi. Hiche jou chun Elijah nung chu ajuijin alhachan apang tan ahi.   
\c 20  
\s1 Ben-Hadad In Samaria Abulu  
\p
\v 1 Hiche phatlai sung hin, Aram lengpa Ben-Hadad in asepai te jouse akhomin chuleh leng somthum le nin asakol ho leh akangtalai jouse pumin apanhun, hiti hin Israel te khopi Samaria chu aum uvin gal in anokhum tauvin ahi.  
\v 2 Ben-Hadad in Israel lengpa Ahab hengah mi asol'in, “Hiche hi Ben-Hadad kiti pan kasei ahi:  
\v 3 'Na insunga na sana leh na dangka chuleh najite le nachate aphalai chengse chu keiya hidiu ahitai!'” agatisah tai.   
\p
\v 4 Chunin Israel lengpan adonbut in, “Kapu lengpan nasei ho chu adih sohkeije kanei jouse hi nanga ahi!” ati.   
\p
\v 5 Ben-Hadad in gangtah in adonbutna thu chu athot kit in, “Hiche hi Ben-Hadad keima thuthot ahi: 'Na sana leh na dangka chuleh naji na chate neipeh ding ahi tia, thu kapehsa nahitai.  
\v 6 Ahinlah, jing nikho tuphat tah leh, na leng inpi le navaipote in jouse khol’a thil manlua agel jouseu kilah dia kavaipote kahinsol ding ahi!'” agatisah kit in ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Hiche jou chun Ahab in agamsung upa chingthei ho jouse akhomin, amaho kom'a chun, “Veuvin hiche pa hin eisuboi lheh jengun ahi! Aman akingeh bangin keiman ka sana leh ka dangka chuleh kaji ka chate chu kana phalpeh tan ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 8 Amipite leh upa chingthei ho chun, “Hiche kalval chun imacha phalpeh tahih in,” atipeh un ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Hichun Ahab in Ben-Hadad sottolle ho kom'a chun, “Kapu lengpa kom'a chun hiti hin seipeh tauvin, amasa a nathil ngeh ho chu ka phalpeh jeng e, ahinlah tua achaina a nathil ngeh ho vang hi kasang theipoi,” ati. Hiti chun sottole ho chun hiche thu chu apo uvin Ben-Hadad hengah akile tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Hichun Ben-Hadad in Ahab chu hiti hin thu athot kit e: “Keiman na khopi Samaria hi vogoihel’a ahalsi sia khut a choidoh kham mihem kahin puilut ding ka suhmang ding ahi. Hichu kaboldoh lou le ka hou pathen ten eithat jeng hen,” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Israel lengpa Ahab in ahin donbut in: “Galmun’a galsat dia sepai khat in achemjam akipoh nung’a, galsat chaisa ho ham hoithoa thucheng chu bol ngai ahipoi, tin seipeh un,” ati.   
\p
\v 12 Ben-Hadad leh apanpi leng dang ho toh, ponbuh sunga ju ana donlai tah un, Ahab donbutna thucheng chu aja tauvin ahi. Hichun Ben-Hadad chun asepai te kom’ah galsat din kigo uvin tin thu apetan ahi. Hijeh chun khopi chu nokhum dingin akigo tauvin ahi.   
\s1 Ahab In Ben-Hadad Galjona Anei  
\p
\v 13 Hiche kahlah chun, themgao khat Israel lengpa Ahab kimupi din achen, “Pakaijin hiti hin thu aseiye, ‘Hiche galmi hon tamtah hokhu numu am? Tunia amaho khu nangma khutna ka pehdoh ding chule galjona nanei ding ahi. Hiteng chuleh nangman keima hi Pakai kitipa chu kahi nei hetdoh ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Hichun Ahab in, “Ipiti ahinbol ding ham?” tin adongin ahi.  
\p Chuin themgaopa chun ahin donbut in, “Hiche hi Pakaijin asei ahi: Gamkai vaipo hon abol dingu ahi,” ati.  
\p “Keihon ka nokhum masat diu ham?” tin Ahab in adong'e.  
\p Themgao pan, “Henge,” ati.   
\p
\v 15 Hichun Ahab in gamkai vaipo ho chu asimtoh leh, mi 232 ahiuvin ahi. Chujouvin Israel sepai jouse chu asimtoh leh 7,000 alhing in ahi.  
\v 16 Sunkim dontah chun, Ben-Hadad leh akiloipi leng somthum le ni ho chun aponbuh sung uvah ju ana don khom’un ahi.  
\v 17 Hichun gamkai lamkaiho chu khopi sunga kon chun ahung kitoldoh masapen un ahileh,  
\p Ben-Hadad sepai ho chun akom'ah, “Samaria a kon'in sepai phabep ahung kitol doh uve,” atin atiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Ben-Hadad in, “Amaho chu chamna a hung hiu hen lang, galsat dinga hung hijongleu ahingin man pou-pouvun,” ati.   
\p
\v 19 Ahinlah sepai te apumpi ahin, gamkai lamkaiho ahin, abon’un galsat dingin ahung kondoh tauvin ahi.  
\v 20 Israel sepai te chun Aram sepai akimaitopi cheh u athat un ahile, Aram sepaiho chu atiu ajan, ajammang gam tauvin ahi. Hichun Israel ten anungdel’un ahileh Ben-Hadad lengpa leh sakol kangtalaiya touthem phabep chu ana jamdoh man’un ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Ahiyeng vang'in, Israel lengpa chun Aram mite sakol dang ho leh sakol kangtalai ho chu ana ban suhmang peh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Phat chomkhat jouvin themgaopa chun, Ahab Lengpa kom'ah, “Na hung nokhum kit diu ahin kigingphan, Aram lengpa chun khovei chavang phatleh hung kit ding ahi hijeh chun thil ho kigontoh in,” ati.   
\s1 Ben-Hadad In Anivei Channa Ahung Bulu  
\p
\v 23 Agallel jou nungin, agal lamkai hon Ben-Hadad jah a, “Israel te Pathen hi thinglhang gam Pathen ahiuve, hijeh a chu thinglhanga eijou ahi. Phaicham a kisatpi leuhen bailamtah a gal ijo jeng diu ahi.  
\v 24 Hiche chung’a bou hin leng ho athunei nauva kon'in haisah inlang, akhel in sepai lamkai ho pansah in!  
\v 25 Sepai alhasam jat hi subulhing kit in, sepai te sakol leh kangtalai te atil'a jat maman subulhing kit in, chutengleh phaicham ah kisatpi leuveng kajo tei diu ahi,” atiuve. Hiti chun Ben-Hadad in jong angaichat bang’un abolpeh soh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 26 A kumkit chavang lai ahiphat in, Aram sepai te asemtoh sohkeijin Israel te kisatpi dingin tuchung hin Aphek lang ajon tauvin ahi.  
\v 27 Isrtael te jong akisemtoh un, neh leh chah jong hoitah in akigontoh un, galsat dingin ahung kitol tauvin ahi. Ahinlah Israel sepai te alhomdan uchu, kelcha hon lhomcha ni kijot a toh abangun ahi. Aram sepai te vang chu gamsung pumpi adim lha jengun ahi.  
\v 28 Hichun Pathen mipa chun Israel lengpa kom’ah achen, “Pakaijin hiti hin aseiye, Aram sepai ten hiti hin aseiyun ahi, a Pakai u khu thinglhang pathen ahin, phaicham pathen ahipoi. Hijeh chun hiche sepai tamtah tehi kajopeh diu ahi, chutengleh nang hon Pakai kahi chu nei hetdoh diu ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 29 Hiche galmi teni hin nisagi sungin kimai ngat ton ngahmun akisem’un, anaum un ahi. Nisagi lhinnin akisatto pan tauvin ahi. Israel ten nikhat sungin Aram keng sepai ho chu 100,000 ana that un ahi.  
\v 30 Adangse chu Aphek khopi sung’ah ajamlut un ahi, ahin akulpi pal’u chun ahin chimkhum un ahile, mi 27,000 jen athiuvin ahi. Ben-Hadad chu khopi sung’a ajamlut in, indan sungnung khat ah akisel tan ahi.   
\p
\v 31 Ben-Hadad sepai lamkai hon akom’ah, “Pu, Israel lengte hi mikhoto athem un ahi, hijeh chun eihon khaodip pon itaibuh uva kiveiju hitin, iluchang uva khaohol kiveiju hitin chutengleh Israel lengpa henga chun, galut jeng tem uhite, ajeh chu ama khun na hinghoi jeng maithei ahi,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 32 Hijeh chun ama hon ataibuh dung uva khaodip pon akiveijun, aluchung uva khaohol akikhu uvin, Israel lengpa henga chun acheuvin, “Nasohpa Ben-Hadad chun aseijin, 'Lungset tah in nei hinghoi tei-teijin!” atiuve.  
\p Hichun Ahab chun adongin, “Ben-Hadad chu hing nalai ham? Ama chu ka sopipa ahi bouve!” ati tai.   
\p
\v 33 Ben-Hadad sepai ten Ahab in asei chu thilpha ahi tin akilah un, gangtah in, “Henge, na sopipa Ben-Hadad ahi!” atiuve.  
\p Ahab in amaho jah a chun, “Cheuvin lang, hin puidoh un,” ati. Chuin Ben-Hadad ahunglhun phat in, Ahab in akangtalai chung’ah akaldoh sah in ahi.   
\p
\v 34 Hichun Ben-Hadad in Ahab jah a, “Kapan napa a konna ana lahpeh khopi ho jouse chu abonchan keiman nangma nalekit tang’e, chule nangman kapa in Samaria khopi sung’a abolna bang bangin nangin jong, Damascus khopi sunga kailhang tampi na semdoh thei ahi,” ati.  
\p Chuin Ahab in, “Hitobang ding chun kenjong nangma nalha tang’e,” atin ahi. Hiti chun Ahab in Ben-Hadad chutoh kitepna asem tan, ama jong alhadoh tai.   
\s1 Themgaopan Ahab Apho  
\p
\v 35 Pakaijin themgao hon lah a mikhat chu midang khat kom’ah thu aseisah in, “Neivo in,” ati. Ahin mipa chun themngaopa sat ding chun anompoi.  
\v 36 Hichun themgaopan ama kom'ah, “Pakai thupeh nanit loujeh a, keima nei dalhah lhah tengleh keipi-bahkai jin natha ding ahitai,” ati. Hiti chun adalhah leh keipi-bahkai khat in athat tan ahi. \x + \xo 20:36 \xt 1 Lgt 13:24\x*   
\p
\v 37 Hijou chun themgaopa chun midang khat kom'ah, “Neivo in!” ati. Hichun themgaopa chu avo'n amavo tan ahi.   
\p
\v 38 Hichun Themgaopan ponin mai akitom in, limput akhel’in, Israel lengpa hungna ding lampia ana ngah tan ahi.  
\v 39 Lengpan ahung phat in themgaopan ahin kouvin, “Pu, keima gal kiha satna laitah a chun kana jaovin, phulou helouvin mikhat in gal hing khat ahinkai jin, 'Amapa hi phaten ana chingtup in, itiham khatna na lhaso a ahileh nathi ding ahilouleh dangka talent khat na leu ding ahi, ahung ti.'  
\v 40 Ahinlah keima thil khat bolla kakisahlel laitah in, ama chu ana jamdoh tan ahi,” ati.  
\p Hichun lengpan, “Achutileh nangma thepmo hichula, nangman na chunga thutanna nakiloilut ahitai,” tin adonbut in ahi.   
\p
\v 41 Hichun themgaopa chun amit kitom chu ahin ladoh in ahileh lengpan themgao ho lah a khat ahi tichu ahedoh tan ahi.  
\v 42 Chuin themgaopa chun, “Pakaijin hiti hin aseiye, keiman na suhmang ding ahi kati pa chu nalhaso jeh in tua hi nangma amakhel’a nathi ding ahitai chuleh ama mite khel’a nangma mite thi diu ahitai,” ati.  
\v 43 Hichun Israel lengpa chu lunghang tah leh maithim ketkut in a inlam ajon tan ahi.   
\c 21  
\s1 Naboth Lengpilei  
\p
\v 1 Jezreel a kon'in Naboth kiti mikhat anaum in, ama hin Samaria lengpa Ahab leng inpi toh kinaicha in, Jezreel mun a chun lengpilei khat ana neijin ahi.  
\v 2 Nikhat hi Ahab in Naboth kom'ah, “Na lengpilei hi ka leng inpi toh akinai jeh in, hon a kanei dingin nei kichoh sah tan, akhel in hiche sang’a lengpilei phajo nape ingting ahilou le na deijoh leh aman dingin sum joh pelhon nang’e,” atipeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Ahin Naboth in adonbut in, “Kapu kapa khang’a pat a kagou chin khat chu nang ka pehdoh jeng ding vang chu Pakai jahnom lou himai hen,” atipeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Hiche Naboth donbutna chun Ahab chu alunghan sah lheh jengin, lung nommo tah in a inlang’a achetan ahi. Lengpa chun an jong ane nom tapon, bang lang angan alum tan ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Ajinu Jezebel chun, “Ipi nati ham? Ipi dinga lung nommo tah a anne louva naum jeng ham?” tin adongin ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Ahab in, “Naboth kom'ah na lengpilei nei kichohsah in ahilouleh akhel nape nang’e, kati leh anom pon ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 7 Jezebel in, “Nangma hi Israel te lengpa nahi hilou ham? Thoudoh inlang an nen, hiche chungthua chun lungkham tahih in, keiman Naboth lengpilei chu nape nang’e,” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Hichun Jezebel in Ahab khel in ama min'in lekha ajih in mohor anam khum in hichun khopi sunga lamkai ho leh upaho kom'a chun lekha athot in ahi.  
\v 9 Lekha achun hitin anajih e: “Mipiho chu an-ngol a tao dingin koukhom unlang, Naboth chu mun thupia tousah un.  
\v 10 Chuleh pannabei mini akom'a tousah unlang, amani chun lengpa le Pathen ataitom’e tin themmo chan uhen. Chujou teng kaidoh unlang songin seplih un,” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Hiti chun khopi sunga upaho leh lamkai ho chun Jezebel lekha a kijih thupeh dungjui chun abol tauvin ahi.  
\v 12 Ama hon anngol ding asom’un, Naboth chu mipi masanga thupitah in atousah un ahi.  
\v 13 Hijou chun pannabei mini chu amasanga atousah un, Naboth chu mipi masanga themmo achan lhon'in, “Ama hin Pathen leh lengpa asamsen ahi,” ati lhon'in ahi. Hijeh chun ama chu khopi polanga akaidoh un songin aseplih tauvin ahi.  
\v 14 Khopi lamkai ho chun Jezebel kom'ah thu athot un, “Naboth chu akiseplih tai,” atiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Chuin Jezebel in hiche thu chu ajah phat in, Ahab jah ah, “Naboth lengpilei nang kom’a ana joh nomlou chu nahet em? Ven ama athi tai, alengpilei khu na kilah thei ahitai,” ati.  
\v 16 Hichun Ahab jong gangtah in achesuh in Naboth lengpilei chu aga kichan tan ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Ahin Pakaijin Elijah kom'ah thu ahin seitan ahi.  
\v 18 “Samaria a vaihompa Israel lengpa Ahab khu gakimupi dingin chesuh tan, ama chu Jezreel munna Naboth lengpi leiya ama dinga akichan pettah nato ding ahi,” ati.  
\v 19 Hiche thu hi ahengah aseipeh in, “Pakaijin hitin aseiye, Naboth natha chu pha khopset lou ham? Hitia pihi anei agou nachom kit nalaiset ding ham? Hitia hi thil nabol jeh in, uicha ten Naboth thisan ale na’u mun a chu nang thisan jong ale diu ahi,” agatisah tai.   
\p
\v 20 Hichun Ahab chu Elijah kom'ah apeng jah jengin, “Tua hi kamelma pan, neihung mudoh kit hitam?” atileh, Elijah in adonbut in, “Henge, nangman Pakai mitmu a thilse jeng bolna a nakipeh jing jeh a kahung kit ahitai,” ati.  
\v 21 Hijeh chun tun Pakaijin hitin aseiye, 'Nangma na vallhum jeng thei manthahna kahin lhun khum sah ding, nangma chilhah te pasal ho chuleh nasohho chujongleh soh hilou ho jong Israel gamsung hoilai mun hijongleh ka suhmang ding ahi.  
\v 22 Keiman Ahijah chapa Baasha insung mite le Nebat chapa Jeroboam insung mite ka suhmang hel banga, nangma insung mite jong ka suhmang ding ahitai. Ajeh chu nangman keima nei sulunghang behseh jengin chuleh nangin Israel tehi na chonset sah tan ahi,' ati   
\p
\v 23 Chuleh Jezebel chung chang ahin, Pakaijin hitin aseiye, ‘Jezreel mun’a gam behkhat chunga Jezebel tahsa chu uichan aneh ding ahi,' ati. \x + \xo 21:23 \xt 2 Lengte 9:36\x*   
\p
\v 24 “Ahab insung mite jouse hiche khopi sunga thiho jouse jong chu uicha hon aneh dingu chuleh gamlah a thiho jouse chu muthong hon aneh diu ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 25 (Ajinu Jezebel in athunun jeh a Ahab in Pakai mitmua thilse bolna a akipehlut banga kipehlut a koimacha dang aumpon ahi.  
\v 26 Athil bolset nasapen chu, milim doi Amor miten ahou bang uva ahou chu ahipen’e. Amaho hi Israel te lhun masanga Pakaijin ana deldoh masat nam mite chu ahiuve.)   
\p
\v 27 Hiche thupeh hi Ahab in ajah phat in, apon abottel in, khaodip pon akisil in, an angol in lunghem tah in khaodip pon chung'ah alum in ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Hichun Pakaiya kon’a thupeh Elijah kom’a ahunglhung kit in,  
\v 29 “Ahab khu keima masanga ichan geiya ama le ama kisunem’a hitam ti namu em? Ama hichan geija aki suhnem tah jeh in, keiman ka bolgot chu ama damsung in bol taponge, achate cheng leh achilhah chunga bou kabol ding, alenggam ka suhmang ding ahitai,” ati.   
\c 22  
\s1 Jehoshaphat Le Ahab  
\p
\v 1 Kum thum sungin Israel leh Aram mite kikah ah gal ana umpon ahi.  
\v 2 Hiche jou kum thum lhinin, Judah lengpa Jehoshaphat in Israel lengpa Ahab chu agavil in ahi.  
\v 3 Aman avil sung hin Israel lengpan asepai te kom'ah, “Nanghon Ramoth-gilead khopi hi eihoa ahi nahet uvem? Ahinla eihon hiche khopi hi Aram lengpa khut a konna nunglah dohna dingin imacha inabol pouvin ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 4 Chuin aman Jehoshaphat lang chu angan, “Nangin Ramoth-gilead nung lahdohna dinga galsatna a hi nei panhu nomlou ham?” atin ahile,  
\p Jehoshaphat in Israel lengpa chu adonbut in, “Ibol a ka panhu da ding ham, nang le kei thakhat ihi chula em, ka sepai te jong na sepai ahin ka sakol ho jong na sakol ahi,” ati.  
\v 5 Jehoshaphat in, “Ahinla Pakajin ipi asei jem veuhite” tin aseibe kit in ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Hichun Israel te lengpan themgao jali ho chu akouvin amaho kom'a chun, “Ramoth-gilead douna gal kakon ding ham ahilouleh kakon louding ham?” tin ana dongin ahi.  
\p Ama hon abon uvin adonbut un, “Aphai, kondoh jengin, Pakaijin galjona napeh ding ahi,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 7 Ahinlah Jehoshaphat in, “Hiche mun'a hi hitobang thudoh ma-ma hijongleh idoh thei diu themgao adang umlou ham,” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Israel lengpan Jehoshaphat jah a, “Hitobanga Pakai kom'a eidohpeh thei diu kahet mikhat aum nalaiye, ahinlah ama hin kei dingin thil phalou ngen aseijin ahi. Ama chu Imlah chapa Micaiah ahi,” tin ana donbut in ahi.  
\p Jehoshaphat in adonbut in, “Leng khat in hitia chu thu asei ngai ahipoi! Aman ipi asei em ngaiju hite,” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Hijeh chun Israel lengpan asepaiho khat chu akouvin, “Imlah chapa Micaiah chu gapui loijin,” ati.   
\s1 Micaiah In Ahab Dounaa Gaothu Asei  
\p
\v 10 Israel lengpa Ahab leh Judah lengpa Jehoshaphat chu leng vonin akivon lhon'in, Samaria khopi kelkot kom changvohna phol munna chun laltouna akido lhon'in atou lhon'in ahi. Ahab themgaoho chun amani masanga chun gaothu aphong-phong jengun ahi.  
\v 11 Amaho lah a khatpen Kenaanah chapa Zedekiah kitipa chun, thih saki lim in asemin hiti hin asamphong in, “Hiti hin Pakaijin aseiye: Hiche thih saki a hi Aram mite na sutlih ding ahi!” ati.   
\p
\v 12 Themgao dang ho jong athusei chu anom un, hitin aseikit uve, “Ramoth-gilead a chun kaltou unlang gal gajouvun, ajeh chu Pakaijin lengpa chu galjona apeh ding ahi!” atiuve.   
\p
\v 13 Alangkhat ah, Micaiah kom'a che asottolpa chun ajah a, “Ven, themgao dang ho jousen lengpa kom'a chun galjona ding ngen aseipeh un, nangin jong amaho bangin galjona ding seipeh in,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Ahinlah Micaiah in adonbut in, “Hingjing Pakai min’a kasei ahi, Pakaijin seijin ati bou kasei ding ahi,” atipeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Micaiah themgao chu lengpa kom alhun phat in, Ahab in jong ajah a, “Micaiah, Ramoth-gilead douna a kache diu ham ahilouleh ka chelou diu ham?” atileh  
\p Micaiah in jong jonkap tah in, “Aphai, chetouvun lang gajouvun, Pakaijin lengpa galjona nape naveh ta!” ati peh in ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Ahin lengpan gangtah in adonbut in, “Pakai thalhenga kakom'a thu nasei tengleh thudih bou seijin tia ijatvei ka ngeh hitam?” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Hichun Micaiah in, “Keiman gaovin thil khat kamu e, Israel te molchunga kelngoi achingbei tobanga akithe cheh kamun ahi, chule Pakaijin a pakai pau akithat ahitai, tun amaho chu lungmong in sol tauvin,” ati. \x + \xo 22:17 \xt Minbu 27:17; Matt 9:36; Mk 6:34\x*   
\p
\v 18 Israel lengpan Jehoshaphat jah a asaptho jengin, “Ka seipehsa hilou ham? Ama hin, kakom'ah thilse tilou thilpha eiseipeh khapon ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 19 Hichun Micaiah in aseiben, “Ngaijun Pakaijin aseiye! Pakai chu avan sepaiho chengin ajet avei’ah aumkim vellun Ama alaltouna a atouve,” ati. \x + \xo 22:19 \xt Job 1:6; Isa 6:1\x*  
\v 20 Pakaijin, ‘Ahab hi athina dinga Ramoth-gilead douna a galkon ding’a koipen atildoh dinga che ding ham? atile, hichea chun  
\p lunggel tamtah aseikhom uvin,  
\v 21 achaina in, lhagao khat in, Pakai kom'a chun keiman choudoh ing kate, ati.   
\p
\v 22 “Pakaijin i-nalo got ham?” atile,  
\p “Lhagao chun adonbut nin keima che ingting Ahab themgao ho thujou asei diuvin gatil doh ing kate” ati.  
\p Hichun Pakaijin na lolhin ding ahi chenlang gabol tan,” ati.   
\p
\v 23 “Tun vetan Pakaijin na themgao ho kom'a thujou aseisah ahitai, ajeh chu Pakaijin na manthahna dinga aphondoh joh ahi,” atipeh tai.   
\p
\v 24 Hichun Kenaanah chapa Zedekiah chun Micaiah chu ajonin angeiphe abehpeh in ahi. “Hoiya patna chu Pakaijin keima eidalhah a, nang kom'a bou thu asei jeng ham?” ati.   
\p
\v 25 Micaiah in adonbut in, “Nangma na insung dan sung khat a aguh a kisel’a nache tengleh hedoh tan nate,” ati.   
\p
\v 26 Chuin Ahab lengpan, “Ama chu man unlang khopi gamvaipo Amon kom leh ka chapa Joash kom'a puilut un,” tin thu apen ahi.  
\v 27 Keima damsel'a kahung kilekit kahsen songkul’a ana hen unlang aneh dingin changlhah leh twi bou anape un, tin seipeh un,” ati.   
\p
\v 28 Hichun Micaiah in adonbut in, “Nangma damsel'a nahung kile pou-pou leh Pakaijin keima eimanchah lou hi ding ahi,” ati. Aban aseibe kit in, “Mijousen ka thusei hi melchih un!” ati.   
\s1 Ahab Thi  
\p
\v 29 Hichun Israel lengpa Ahab leh Judah lengpa Jehoshaphat teni chu asepai jouse toh Ramoth-gilead sat dingin akon lhon tan ahi.  
\v 30 Israel lengpa chun Jehoshaphat jah a, “Hitia hi gal mun’a ilut tengu leh koiman eihetdoh louna dingin kahina khel ing kate, nangin vang na leng von chu kivon tan,” ati. Hiti chun Israel lengpan ahina akhel in galmun’a alut tauve.   
\p
\v 31 Alang khatna Aram lengpan sakol kangtalai touthem lamkai somthum le ni ho jah a chun, “Israel lengpa bou chu nokhum un adang ho chu limsah hih un!” ati.  
\v 32 Hiti chun Aram sakol kangtalai touthem ho chun aleng vonna kivon Jehoshaphat chu adelkhum go tauvin ahi. Ama hon, “Hiche khu Israel te lengpa ahi,” tin ahin sam’un ahi. Ahinlah Jehoshaphat chu ahung penjah phat in,  
\v 33 Sakol kangtalai touthem lamkai ho chun Israel lengpa ahilou ahetdoh phat un adel tapouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 34 Ahin Aram sepai khat in Israel sepai te lah a chu agah moh donkap leh Israel lengpa chu a ompho kikah a chun thal chu alut kha tan ahileh Ahab chun asakol kangtalai tolpa kom'a chun, “Sakol chu nungtol inlang, hichea kon hin nei toldoh tan,” ati.  
\v 35 Nilhum keijin gal chu akisat in, lengpa chu Aram mite lang angan sakol kangtalai chunga chun aki jamin ahi. Athisan chu amaha akon chun tol ah avalhan nilhah langin athi tan ahi.   
\p
\v 36 Nisa chu ahung lhum phat in sepaiho lah a chun, “Gal ilel tauve, na kihinso theina ding cheh un jam tauvin,” tin ahung kisam tan ahi.   
\p
\v 37 Hiti chun lengpa athi tan atahsa chu Samaria a ahin polut un avui tauvin ahi.  
\v 38 Hijou chun asakol kangtalai chu Samaria twikul pang ah asop theng un ahi. Pakaijin ana teppeh bang chun numei kijohho kisilna munna chun athisan chu uicha hon ahung lehgim un ahi.   
\p
\v 39 Ahab vaihom sunga thilsoh ho leh aman ana tohdoh ho, saiha a asahdoh leng inpi ahin khopi ana tundoh ho ahin abonchan \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu\it* a chun aki jihlut in ahi.  
\v 40 Hiti chun Ahab chu athitan ahileh achapa Ahaziah chun lengmun ahin lotan ahi.   
\s1 Jehoshaphat In Judah Gam Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 41 Ahab lengpan Israel mite lah a vai anahop kumli lhinin, Asa chapa Jehoshaphat in Judah mite lah a vai anahom pantan ahi.  
\v 42 Jehoshaphat leng ahungchan chun kum somthum le nga ana lhing tan ahi. Hiti chun aman Jerusalem'ah kum somni le nga vai ana hom’in ahi. Anu chu Shilhi chanu Azubah ahi.   
\p
\v 43 Jehoshaphat chu leng phatah anahi. Ama hin apa Asa phatna hinkho ho chu anung ana juijin ahi. Aman Pathen mitmu’n thilpha jong anabol in ahi. Ama vaihom sungin kithoina doiphung ho chu ana suhtheng sahpon ahi. Hijeh chun mipi ho chun kithoina gantha anabol nalaiyun chuleh gimnamtui jong ana lhutnam jingun ahi.  
\v 44 Jehoshaphat chun Israel lengpa toh kichamna ana semin ahi.   
\p
\v 45 Jehoshaphat vaihom sunga thilsoh ho leh a thaneina ho chuleh agalsatna ho jouse \it Judah Lengte Thusimbu\it* a aum sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 46 Apa Asa khanglaiya jong ana chejom peh pasal le numei kijoh anaum nalai chengse chu gamsunga kon'in ana ban suhmang in ahi.   
\p
\v 47 (Hichelai khang chun Edom gam'a leng ana umpoi.)   
\p
\v 48 Jehoshaphat in Ophir munna sana podingin kiveina kong innei honkhat ana semdoh in ahi. Ahinlah hiche kong innei ho chun agamsung kongkai mun’ah tosetna anato jeh un ana kitol masa pouvin ahi.  
\v 49 Khatvei chu Ahab chapa Ahaziah chun Jehoshaphat kom'ah, “Keima mite leh nangma mite hon kong tolkhom uhen,” ana tin ahileh Jehoshaphat ana nom pon ahi.   
\p
\v 50 Jehoshaphat chu athi phat in David khopi a apu apate toh anavui khom un ahi.   
\s1 Ahaziah In Israel Gam Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 51 Judah lengpa Jehoshaphat in vai ana homna kum som le sagi lhinin, Ahab chapa Ahaziah in Israel te lah a vai ana hom panin ahi. Aman Samaria mun'ah kumni vai ana hom in ahi.  
\v 52 Aman Pakai mitmu in thilse jong ana bollin ahi. Aman hichu anu le apa chonchan phalou tah ana jui ahin, chuleh Israel te ana chonset sah Jeroboam chondan hoilou tah chu ana jui ahi.  
\v 53 Aman Baal milim doi ana houvin, apa bangin Pakai Israel Pathen chu ana chou lunghang in ahi.   